<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2CH" style="id">2 Kronikil</book>
  <para style="h">2 Kronikil</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Kronikil</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Kronikil</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Kronikil</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, David tapa Solomon a gamsung ah hatsak in a om a; Toupa a Pathian a kiang ah a om a, nakpi mahmah in a thupisak hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Solomon in Israel tengteng, sepaih sang heutu, za heutu, vaihawmmi, Israel gam tengteng a milian, inkuan a intekpen tengteng a houpih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in, Solomon leh kikhawm tengteng Gibeon khua a mun sang ah a hoh ua; huai ah Toupa sikha Mosi in gamdai a a bawl Pathian biakna buk a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian bawm bel David in a nabawl khitsa mun ah Kiriath-jearim a kipan David in a latou khin a; Jerusalem ah a koihna ding puanin a zak khitsa him ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan, Hur ta Uri tapa Bezalel bawl dal maitam Toupa biakna buk chin ah a om behlap a; Solomon leh mipite’n a vazuan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Solomon bel kihoupihna puanin chin a dal maitam omna Toupa ma ah a hohtou a, haltum thillat sang khat a lan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huai zan in Solomon kiang ah Pathian a kilak a, a kiang ah, “Bang ahia k’on piak ding hon ngen in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in Solomon in Pathian kiang ah, “Ka pa David kiang ah hehpihna thupitak na langsak a, a sik in kumpipa in n’on bawlta a
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Toupa Pathian, ka pa David kiang a na thuchiam hih tangtun in; nang lei a leivui zah mipite kumpipa in n’on bawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in hiai mipite ma a lut leh pawt a ka om theihna ding in pilna leh theihna honpia in; na mi hiai zahzah vai kuan ahia hawmsak thei ding?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in Pathian in Solomon kiang ah, “Hichibang lungsim na puta, sum leh paite, hauhsaknate, pahtawinate, nang hon mudahte hinnate ngen lou a, damsawtnate leng ngenlou a, a tung ua kumpipa a k’on bawl na mite vai na hawmsak theihna ding a pilna leh theihnate n’on nget zawk ziak in, pilna leh theihna piak na hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in na ma a Kumpipate’n a na neih ngeilouh uh, nang nung a leng a neih hetlouh ding uh sum leh paite, hauhsaknate, pahtawinate k’on pelai ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in Solomon mun sang chin a biakbuk omna Gibeon khua a zin Jerusalem ah a pai a, Israel tung ah vai a hawmta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan, Solomon in kangtalaite leh sakol tungtuangmite a kaikhawm a; kangtalai sang khat leh za li leh sakol tungtuangmi sing khat leh sang nih a nei a, huaite kangtalai koihna khuate leh Jerusalem khua a kumpipa omnate ah a koih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa’n Jerusalem khua ah dangkaeng leh dangkasikte suangtum bang mai in a koih a, sidar singte leng phaizang a theipi sing bang a tam in a koih lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Solomon neih sakolte Aigupta gam a kipan a lakkhiak ahi; kumpipa sumsinmite’n huaite a honhon in a khakzel ua, a hon a leizel ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aiguptate gam a kangtalaite bel dangkasik sekel za guk zel in a leikhiaksak zel ua; sakolte dangkasik sekel za leh sawmnga zel in; huchi mah bang in Hitte kumpipa tengteng leh Suria kumpipate kiang ah leng a zuaksawn zel uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Solomon in Toupa min ading inn leh kumpipa inn ding toh lam a tum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Solomon in van paw ding mi sing sagih leh, mual a sing phukmi sing giat leh amau vengmi sang thum leh za guk a sep hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Solomon in Tura kumpipa Huram kiang ah, “Ka pa David thil na hihsak a, a omna inn lamna ding sidarte na khak bang in, keileng hon kithuahpih sam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai dih, Toupa ka Pathian min a inn amah adia lam a, a ma a gimlim hala, tanghou siah koih gige a, khawlnite, kha thakte, Toupa ka Pathian Ankuanglui nite a zingsang leh nitak a haltum thillat latna ding inn ka lam ding ahi. Hiaite Israelte ading in tangtawn thuseh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in ka inn lam tup thupi mahmah ding ahi, ka Pathian uh Pathian tengteng sang a thupizaw a hih ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Van, vante van ah leng talou ahi ngal a, kuan ahia a inn lamsak thei ding? Kei, a ma a gimlim halna ding lel chihlouh ngal kei leltakin ka lamsak thei mahmah ding hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in Judah gam leh Jerusalem a mi khutsiamte ka pa David in a na zatsek tuin ka kiang a omte lak a sem ding in mi khat, dangkaeng, dangkasik, dal, sik lam khoih thei, puan sandup, sanau, dumpuang bawl siam, gelh bangchibang peuh siammi honsawl in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lebanon a sidar sing, meilah sing, algum sing leng hon khak lechin; na mite’n Lebanon a singphuk a siam mahmah uh chih ka thei ngal a; huchi in ngai dih, ka mite nang mite lak ah tel sam le uh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sing tampi hon ngaihtuah sak ding: ka inn lam tup a thupi mahmah ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngai dih, na singphukmite huit buh pawt a a sing nih leh barli buh pawt a sing nih leh uain bath sing nih leh thau bath sing nih ka pe ding” chi in mi a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in Tura kumpipa Huram in, “Toupa’n a mite a it ziak in a kumpipa ding ua nang honbawl eive” chi in Solomon lai in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huram in, “ Toupa , Israelte Pathian, lei leh van bawlpa, Toupa inn leh kumpipa inn lam ding a pilna leh theihna nei tapa piltak kumpipa David pepa phat in om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi khutsiam, theihtheihna nei, ka pa Huram amah mah, k’on sawl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Dan suan a mi numei khat tapa ngei, a pa bel Tura khua a mi, dangkaeng lam, dangkasik lam, dal lam, sik lam, suang lam, sing lam, puan sandup, dumpuang, puanmalngat, sandang khoihsa, gelh bangchibang leng siam, siam chiteng siam ahi a; nang mi khutsiamte leh ka pu na pa David khutsiamte lak ah a hongsem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in huit buh, barli buh, thau, uain thu ka toupa’n a gen a sikhate hon khak hen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in kou Lebanon a sing na deih zahzah ka na phuk ding ua, tuipi ah Jopa tan in k’on tolhsak ding uh; huan, nang Jerusalem ah na nawn tou ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan, Solomon in Israel gam a a pa David in a simsa, namdang mi tengteng a sim a, nuai khat leh sing nga leh sang thum leh za guk ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi in van paw ding mi sing sagih leh mual a sing phuk mi sing giat leh, mipite sepdan ngaihtuahsak ding mi sang thum leh za guk a sep hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in, Solomon in Jerusalem ah, Moriah tang, a pa David kiang a Toupa kilakna, Jebus mi Ornan phualzang, David sehsa ah Toupa inn a lam panta hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A vaihawm kumli kum, kha nihna, ni nihni in a lam panta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian inn lamdan ding Solomon in a ngaihtuah dan hichibang ahi. A dunglam tong tehdan ngeina in tong sawmguk ahi a, a vailam tong sawmnih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A malam a inlim dunglam in vailam tan mah tong sawmnih ahi a, a sanlam za leh sawmnih ahi a, asung dangkaeng chi kia in a luan hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Dantan lianzaw pen bang ah meilah sing a thuap a, huai dangkaeng chi kia in a luan a, huai ah tumsing leh khainiang lim a tuangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in a kilawmsak ding in bel suangmantam in a zem a, dangkaeng bel Paravaim dangkaeng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />inn bel, kalhkangte, bangte, a pialkhangte, kongkhakte dangkaeng in a luan a; bangte ah Cherub limte a tuangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mun siangthoupen a bawl a, a dunglam in vailam tan mah, tong sawmnih ahi a, a vailam bel tong sawmnih ahi a, dangkaeng chi ngen in a luan a, talent za guk a pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A kilhna gikdan dangkaeng sekel sawmnga ahi. Dantan tungnungte dangkaeng in a luan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Inn siangthou pen ah Cherub lim nih a bawl a, huaite dangkaeng in a luan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cherub khate’n tong sawmnih a khak a, Cherub khat kha tong nga ahi a, bang a pha a, huan, a kha langkhat leng tong nga mah ahi a, Cherub khat kha a pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in Cherub dang khat kha leng tong nga ahi a, bang a pha a; huan, a kha langkhat tong nga mah ahi a, Cherub khat kha a pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cherubte’n tong sawmnih khak in a kha uh a zak ua, ading ua, inn sung lam nga in ading uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Puanzak ding a dumpuang, a sandup, a sanau, khauzang ngatte in a bawl a, huai ah Cherub lim a tuangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Inn mailam ah tong sawmthum leh tong nga a sang khuam nih a phut a, huaite dawn tong nga tuaktuak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huai ah khainiang a bawl a, khuamdawn ah a vial a; theibuhfai za a bawl a, khainiang ah a khai hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Biakin mailam ah khuam a phut a, khat taklam ah, khat veilam ah, taklam a pen Jakin a chi a, veilam a pen Boaz a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Dal maitam, a dunglam tong sawmnih, a vailam tong sawmnih, a sandan tong sawm a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Dal lawhbem lianpi, a gei leh a gei kikal a tong sawm kia, a sandan tong nga a bawl a; a gei a kimvel in tong sawmthum ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A geinuai bawngtal limte in a velsuak a, tong khat ah sawmzel, dal lawh kimvel in a om hi. Bawngtal limte vualnih ahi a, dal lawh a kimat a sun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in bel bawngtal sawmlehnih tung ah a ki nga a, thum in mallam a nga ua, thum in tumlam a nga ua, thum in simlam a nga ua, thum in suahlam a nga uh; dal lawh bel huaite tung ah a koih a, a nunglam a nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lawh pen khutpek tan in a sah a, a gei bel nou gei bang, lili pak bang a bawl ahi a, bath sang thum ta ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kisilna ding kuangzawn, sawm a bawl lai a, taklam sang ah nga a tung a, veilam sang ah nga a tung a; huaite bel haltum thillat silna ding ahi; huan, dal lawhbem bel siampute kisilna ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huan, bawl dan ding a a seh bang in, dangkaeng khawnvak koihna sawm a bawl a, biakin sung taklam ah nga, veilam ah nga a koih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Dohkan sawm a bawllai a, biakin sung ah taklam ah nga, veilam ah nga a koih a, dangkaeng kuangzawn zakhat a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huailou leng siampute huang leh huang zapite a um a, huang kongkhakte a bawl a, dal in a luan hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lawh pen inn taklam pang ah suahlam ah simdoh in a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huram in belte, vutluahnate, kuangzawnte a bawl hi. Huchi in Pathian inn ading a kumpipa Solomon a bawlsak Huram in a zouta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khuam nihte, nou bemte khuam dawn a zing nihte, khuam dawn a nou bem nihte tuamna gial chitek nihte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huai tuamna gial chitek nih ding a theibuhfai zalite khuam dawn a noubial nih tuamna ding gial chitek tuaktuak ding a theibuhfai vual nihte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kingaknate, kingakna tung a kuangzawnte leng a bawl a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lawh khat leh a nuai a bawngtal sawmlehnihte toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Belte, vutluahnate, sathuknate leh a tuium-belsuan tengteng leng Huram in Toupa inn adia dal nawttet a kumpipa Solomon a bawlsak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huaite Jordan phaizang ah Sukoth leh Zered bellei mun ah kumpipa’n asung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchibang in Solomon in tuium-belsuan tampi a bawl a; dalbel buk seng vual ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Solomon in Pathian inn a tuium-belsuan om tengteng a bawl a, dangkaeng maitamte, tanghou koihna dohkante.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Seh bang a Mun Siangthou mai a det ding khawnvak koihnate, a khawnvak nangawn toh, dangkaeng keleu ngen in a bawl hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Dangkaeng pakte, khawnvakte leh taitehte, dangkaeng siang ngen in a bawl hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khawnvak puantehnate, maiphiat kuangte, keute, meilaknate dangkaeng siangngen mah in; huan, inn sung lutna, inn sunggil zaw Mun Siangthou pen kongkhakte leh a inn, Biakin kongkhak te dangkaeng in a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in Solomon in Toupa inn ding a lamzou vekta a; Solomon in a pa David in thil a na latsa tengteng a lalut a, dangkasik, dangkaeng, vanzat tengteng Pathian inn a goukoihna ah a koihta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in Solomon in Israel upate, a nam intekte, Israel suante inkuan intekte tengteng, David khopi Zion a kipan Toupa thukhun bawm zawngtou ding in Jerusalem khua ah a kaikhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in Israel mi tengteng kha sagihna a Ankuangluina ah kumpipa kiang ah a hoh khawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel Upa tengteng a hong ua, Levite’n bawm a zawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa bawm leh, kihoupihna puanin leh Puanin a tuium-belsuan siangthou tengteng a zawngtou ua; siampu Levite’n a zawngtou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumpipa Solomon leh Israelte paikhawm tengteng a kiang a hong kikhawmte bawm ma ah a omkhawm ua, belam leh bawngtal genseng vuallouh leh simseng vuallouh in a kithoih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in siampute’n Toupa thukhun bawm a omna ding ah a la lut ua, insung a biakna mun, Mun Siangthou pen ah, cherubte kha nuai ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cherubte’n bawm omna tung zawn ah a kha uh a zak gige ua, cherubte’n bawm leh a zawnna chiangtawnte a khuh vek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A zawnna chiangtawnte a sau mahmah a, a zawnna chiangtawnte kongte biakna mun mai, Mun Siangthou a kipan in a muhtheih a; himahleh pawlam ah zaw a dawk kei hi: tu tan huai ah om nilouh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aigupta gam a kipan a pawt ua, Toupa’n Israel suante kiang a thu a khunlai Mosi in Horeb tang a suangpek nih a koih kia loungal huai bawm sung ah bangmah dang a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi a, siampute Mun Siangthou a kipan a a hongpawt tak un, siampu omte tengteng a kisiangsak ua, a pawl in a kibawl tuankei ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Levite lasami tengteng leng avek un, Asaph, Heman, Jeduthun, a tapate uh leh a unaute uh toh, puanmalngat silh a kivan in dakkhutbette, pekgingte, kaihgingte toh, maitam suahlam sang ah ading ua, a lak uah siampu za leh sawmnih pengkul mut in a omlai uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, pengkul mutte leh lasamite’n Toupa Phatna leh kipah thu genna dia a tumging uh gingkhat bang mai in a kiza a; pengkul leh dakkhutbet leh thil tumging toh a aw uh a suah ua, “Amah lah a hoih ngal a; a chitna tangtawn a om ding ahi ngal a” chi a Toupa a phat uleh, Toupa inn meipi in a dim meuhmouh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in meipi ziak in siampute’n na a sem theikei ua; Toupa thupina in Pathian inn a dimvek hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in Solomon in thu a gen a, “ Toupa’n , mial bikbek ah ka om ding, a chi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Himahleh na tenna ding, tangtawn a na om na ding inn k’on lamsakta hi” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa a kihei a, Israel kikhawm tengteng a vualzawl a; Israel kikhawmte ading khawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aman, “ Toupa Israelte Pathian, ka pa David kiang a amah kam mahmah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aigupta gam a kipan ka mi Israelte ka pikhiak ni a kipan Israelte nam lak a koi khua mah ka min omna ding inn lamna ding ka tel ngeikei a; ka mi Israelte tung a heutu ding mi kuamah ka tel ngeikei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Himahleh, ka min omna ding in Jerusalem ka telta a, ka mi Israelte heutu ding in David ka tel hi, chi a genpa, amah khut mahmah a hon pichingsakpa phat in om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka pa David in Israelte Pathian, Toupa min ding a inn lam a ngaihtuah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Himahleh Toupa’n ka pa, David kiang ah, ka min ding a inn lam na ngaihtuah a, hichibang lungsim nana put na hih hoih hi; himahleh nang zaw inn na lam kei ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na tapa, na khal a hongpawt ding in ka min ding in inn a hon lamzaw ding, a na chita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa’n a thugen a tangtungsakta a: Toupa chiamsa bang ngei in ka pa David mun k’on luah a, Israel mangtutphah ah ka hongtu a, Israel Pathian Toupa min ding inn k’on lamta ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huai ah Israel suante kiang a na khun, Toupa thukhun bawm ka koihta ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan, Toupa maitam bul ah Israel kikhawm tengteng muh in ading a, a ban a zak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Solomon in dal dohkan a saulam tong nga, a zatlam tong nga, a sanlam tong thum a bawl biakin huang laitak a tun tung ah a tuang a, Israel kikhawm tengteng ma ah a khuk din a, vanlam nga in a ban a zak a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Aw Toupa , Israelte Pathian, lei leh van ah nangmah bang mahmah Pathian a omkei uh, a lungtang tengteng ua na lampi tawnmi a sikhate tung a thukhun tangtung sak a hehpihna kem,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na sikha ka pa David kiang a, na thuchiam na tangtung sak a; ahi, tuni in na kam a na gensa na khut in na lohching sakta a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in aw Toupa , Israelte Pathian, na sikha ka pa, David kiang a, na suante na om bang a omsam ding a omdan ua a pilvan peuhmah uleh, ka mit muh a Israelte mangtutphah a tu ding na tasam kei ding, chi a na chiamsa tangtung sak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa , Israelte Pathian, na sikha, David kiang a, na thugen lohchingsak mahmah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Himahleh, Pathian lei ah mihing lak ah om petmah dia hia? Ngai in, van, vante van ah leng na takei a, hiai ka inn lam ah takei sem natel ni chia!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Himahleh, aw Toupa ka Pathian na sikha in nang a hon sapna leh a thumna ngaihkhiak sak in, na sikha thumna leh ngetna hon limsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hiai munlam nga a na sikha a thumna ngaikhia a, Huai ah ka min a om ding, na chihna mun mahmah, inn lam ah sun leh zan a na mit suan gige theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na sikha leh na mi Israelte’n hiai mun lam nga a a thum chiang un a ngetnate uh na ngaihkhiak sak zel in, ahi, na tenna mun van ah na ngaikhia inla, na ngaikhia in, ngaidam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Mi kuapeuh in a invengte tung ah thil hihkhial in, kichiamsak hong kiphamoh taleh, hiai inn a na maitam ma ah hong kichiam henla;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nang van ah na ngaikhia inla, gamtang inla, migilou a gitlouh man a mawh tangsak in, mi diktat a diktak man a dik tangsak in, na sikhate vaihawmsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Na mi Israelte’n na tung a thil a hihkhelh ziak ua melmate lak a a vuallelh ua, nang lam a hong ngat nawn ua, na min a gup ua, hiai inn a thum a thil na kiang a a hon nget uleh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nang van ah na ngaihkhiak sak inla, na mi Israelte khelhna ngaidam inla, amau leh a pi leh pute uh na piak gam ah pi nawn in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Na tung a thil a hihkhelh ziak ua van a hongbina, vuah a hong zuklouha, hiai mun lam nga a a thum ua, na min a gup uleh, amau na hihgim ziak a a khelhna uh a kisik uleh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nang van ah na ngaikhia inla, a paina ding uh lampi hoih kawkmuh in na sikhate leh na mi Israelte khelhna ngaidam in na mite a goutan ding ua na piakna gam ah vuah zusak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka gam ua kial a hong kiaka, hii a honglen a, keuna hiam, muatna hiam, khaukhup hiam, lung hiam a hongom a, a melmate un a khuate uh a hongum ua, hii bangpeuh, natna bangpeuh a hongtun leh hii a vei uhiam, a lungkham na uh theipih in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Hiai inn lam nga a banzak a mimal hiam, Israel mipi hon in hiam thumna leh ngetna a hontut uh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na omna van ah na ngaikhia inla, ngaidam inla, michih a omdan bang chiat un lohchingsak in, a lungtang uh lah na thei ngal a: nangmah kia mihing tate lungtang theipa na hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Ka pi leh pute uh na piak gam a omsung teng ua na lampi tawn thei ding a nang laudan a hong siamna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“ Na mi Israelte hilou, namdang mi, na min thupitak leh na khut hattak leh na banzak ziak a gam gamla tak a kipan a hongpai, hiai inn lam nga a a hong thum chiang un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nang na omna van ah na ngaikhia inla, namdangte leng nang hon sapdan uh dungzui in a tung uah hih in, huchi in na mi Israelte bangmah in khovel a namchih in na min a thei ding ua, nang laudan a hongsiam ding ua, hiai ka inn lam in na min a pu chih a thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Na mite’n a melmate uh na sawlna lamlam a a sual ua na khopi tel leh na min omna dia na lam inn lam nga a na kiang a a thum uleh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Nang a thumna uh leh a ngetna uh van ah na ngaikhia inla, a thu uah pi zel in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Na tung a a hong khelh ua, kuamah lah khiallou a om ngalkei a, a tung ua na heh a, melma khut a na piak a, gam gamlapi ah hiam, naideuh ah hiam sal a a pi un leng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Sal a a pina gam ua a kingaihtuah khiak ua, a kisik ua, i na khialta, dikloutak leh gitlouhhuai tak in thil i na hihta, chi a a tanna gam ua ngetna hontut ua:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Sal a amau a pi na ua, a tanna gam ua a lungtang tak uleh a lungsim taktak ua nanglam a hong ngat ua, a pi leh pute uh gam lam leh na khopi tel leh na min dia ka lam inn lam nga a na kiang a a thum uleh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A thumna uh leh a ngetna uh nang na omna van ah na ngaikhia inla, a thu uah pi zel inla, na tung a na khialta na mite ngaidam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Aw ka Pathian, hehpih in na mit honghak inla, hiai mun a thumna ah na bil dohin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“Aw Toupa Pathian, na omna mun ah paitou in nang leh na hatna bawm toh, Aw Toupa Pathian, na siampute na hotdamna in van inla, na misiangthoute hoihna in nuamsa sak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Aw Toupa Pathian, na thau nilhpa mel lehngatsan kenla, na sikha David thil hoih hihte theigige in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in Solomon a thum khit in van a kipan mei a hong lengsuka, haltum thillat leh kithoihnate a hong kangmangta a, huan Toupa thupina’n inn a dimta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa thupina in Toupa inn a dimsak ziak in Toupa inn ah siampute a lut theikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel suante in van a kipan a mei hong lengsuk leh inn tung a Toupa thupina a en nilouh ua, suanglep tung ah mai a leisi in a khupboh in Toupa phat in a bia uhi. “Amah lah a hoih ngal a, a chitna tangtawn in a om ding hi, chi in chibai a buk ua, kipahthu a gen uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpipa leh mipite’n Toupa ma ah kithoihnate a lan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kumpipa Solomon in kithoihna bawngtal sing nih leh sang nih leh belam nuai khat leh sing nih a lan uhi. Huchibang in kumpipa leh mipite’n Pathian inn a lan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan, siampute a mun chiat uah ading ua; Levite leng Toupa kiang a kipahthu genna ding a phuah, a chitna tangtawn in a om ding hi, chi a Toupa phatna dia David in a zatsek, thil gingthei toh Toupa lasa in ading ua; huchi in siampute’n pengkul a mut ua, Israel mi tengteng ading diamduam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Solomon in Toupa inn mazawn a umsung kongtual a hih siangthou behlap a; huai ah haltum thillatte, lemna thillat thaute a lan a; Solomon dal maitam bawl haltum thillat, tangbuang thillat, thaute latna ding a a neuluat ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in, huai tung in Solomon leh Israel mi tengteng mipi kikaikhawm thupitak Hamath kholutna a kipan a Aigupta gam luipha a mite toh ni sagih Ankuang a lui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A ni giat ni’n kikhopna tak a nei ua; maitam kipahpihna ding in ni sagih a zang ua, Ankuanglui ni ading in ni sagih a zang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in kha sagih na ni sawmnih leh thum nin mipite a kikhensak a, Toupa’n David leh Solomon leh a mi Israelte tung a a hoihna a latsak ziak in nuamsatak leh kipaktak in mite a inlam uah a paita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchibang in, Solomon in Toupa inn leh kumpipa inn a pichinta a; Solomon in a lungsim a a tup bang in Toupa inn leh amah inn lamzangtak in a pichinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan, zan in Solomon kiang ah Toupa a hong kilak a, a kiang ah, “Na thumna ka za a, hiai mun kei adin kithoihna inn din ka sepkhin hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vante ka khak a, vuahte a zuklouh in hiam, khaukhup ka sawl a, gamte a hihsiat hiam ka mite lak a hi ka lensak hiam a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka minpu ka mite kingaineu a a thum ua, hon zon ua, a omdan giloute uh a lehngatsan uleh van a kipan in ka na ngaikhe ding a, a khelhna uh ka ngaidam ding a, a gam uh ka damsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hiai mun a thumna ka mit ka suan ding a, ka bil ka doh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huai a ka min tangtawn a a omtheihna ding in hiai inn ka sep a, ka hihsingthouta hi: huai ah ka mit leh ka lungtang a om tawntungta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan, nang tungtang thu ah leng, na pa David bang a ka mitmuh a na om a, thu ka honpiak bang a na om a, ka thusehte leh ka vaihawmte na zuih leh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Israelte lak ah ‘vaihawm mi na tasam kei ding,’ chi a na pa David kiang a ka thukhun bang in ‘na gam mangtutphah ka kipsak ding hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Himahleh na kiheimang ua, ka thusehte leh ka thupiakte na lehngatsan ua, Pathian dangte nna nasep ua, na biak uh leh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amau ka piak gam a kipan k’on hihmang ding a; hiai inn ka min ding a ka hihsiangthousa ka mitmuh phaklouh ah ka suanmang ding a, namchih lak a paunak leh a selam a gentehna ding in ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />‘Hiai inn sangpi a kiang a paipeuh in lamdang a sa ding ua, bangchi a hiai gam leh hiai inn Toupa’n hichi a hih ahia? a chi ding uh.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Toupa , a pi leh pute uh Pathian, ‘Aigupta gam a kipan pikhe pa a lehngatsan ua, Pathian dangte zuia, a biakua, a nnate a sep ziak un hiai siatna tengteng a tung uah a tung ahi, a honchi ding uh a chi hi.’ ”
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi a, Solomon in Toupa inn leh amah inn a lamsung kum sawmnih a bei in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huram in Solomon khua a piakte Solomon inn a bawl a, Israel suante a omsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Solomon in Hamath Zobah a sual a, a zou hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gamdai ah, Tadmor a bawl a, Hamath a vankoihna khuate toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bethhoron saknung zaw leh khangnung zaw leng, kulhte, kongkhakte, a kalhnate nei in a bawl beh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Baalath khuate, a vankoihna khua tengteng, a kangtalai koihna khuate, a sakol tungtuang mite omna khuate, Jerusalem leh Lebanon leh a gamsung tengteng ah Solomon in a deih bangbang in a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel suante hilou, Hitte, Amorte, Perizte, Hivte, Jebuste suan a omlai mite tengteng;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel suante’n a hihman louhte uh, huai gam a amaute nung a nutsiat a om a suante uh, tutan a, Solomon in sikha nasem ding a goih teitei pawl din a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel suante Solomon in a nasemmi sikha ding in a bawl kei a, kidou mite, a sepaih heutute intekte, a kangtalai leh a Sakol tungtuang mi heutu ahizaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huaite mipite heutu, Solomon intek pente ahi ua, za nih leh sawmnga ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Solomon in Pharo tanu David khopi a kipan a tuam a inn a lamsak ah a pitou a, “Ka zi Israel kumpipa David inn a om ding ahi kei, Toupa bawm hongtunna Mun Siangthou ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in, Solomon inlim mailam a kibawl Toupa maitam ah Toupa ding in haltum thillatte a lan hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mosi thupiak, nitenga, ding a bikhiah bangbang in khawlni ah, kha thak ni, Ankuanglui hun nei, kum khat a thumvei, tanghou silngou sohlouh ankuangluinate, nipi kal Ankuangluinate, bawkta Ankuang luinate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan, a pa David na seh bang in siampu pawlte leh Levite a tantuam chiat ua, niteng a sepkul dungzui zel a, phat dingte, siampute ma a nasem ding in a sep a; kongkhak teng ah a pawlpawl a vengmite a seplai a; huchibang in Pathian mi David in a nasep hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kumpipa’n siampute, Levite thu a piak bangchi mah in sumthute leng a pialsan hetkei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa inn a bawlkhiak tung ua kipan a a zohtan un, Solomon in a suktuahsa bang geih ahi. Huchi in Toupa inn pichin ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in Solomon bel Edom gam a luipi gei a Ezion-geber ah leh Eloth ah a hoh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huram in a sikha tuipi a gamtang mi, longte toh a kuansak a: Solomon sikhate toh Ophir ah a hoh ua, huai ah dangkaeng talent za li leh sawmnga a hontun ua, kumpipa Solomon kiang ah hontun uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomon minthan dan Sheba kumpinu’n a zak in Solomon thuhaksa pipi a ettel tum in nungzui mi tampi toh sangawngsaute a gimlim leh dangkaeng tampi leh suangmantamte pua in Jerusalem ah a hohtou a: Solomon kiang a tun touh in, a lungsim a om tengteng suahsiang vek in a houpih hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huan Solomon in a thudot tengteng a dawngvek a: Solomon in a dawn theihlouh himhim a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in Sheba kumpinu’n Solomon pilna leh a inn lam a muh in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A dohkan a nekdingte, a sikhate tutdante, a nasemte nasep dante, a kivat dante uh, a nou pemite leh a kivatdante uh, Toupa inn a hohtouhnate, a lungam hial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kumpipa kiang ah, “Na thilhihte leh na pildan thuthang ka gam a ka zak a dik mahmah hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Himahleh keimah mit mahmah a k’ong muh masiah a gen kia uh ka um theikei a, ngai in, na pildan thupi kimkhat leng a hon na hilh sam ua hia: na minthanna ka zakte nakpi’n na khup hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na mite nak hamphat na uh e, hiai na sikha na kiang a om gige a na pilna thu ngaikhe gigete hampha hina tel uh e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian, na tung a kipak, a kumpipa ding a a mangtutphah a hon tusakpa Toupa na Pathian phat in om hen: na Pathian in Israelte tangtawn a hihkip ding in a it a, huaiziak in diktattak a vaihawm ding in a kumpipa ding ua nang honbawl eive” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa kiang ah dangkaeng talent za leh sawmnih leh gimlim tampi mahmah leh suangmantamte a pia a, Sheba kumpinu’n kumpipa Solomon gimlim a piak bang himhim a om ngeikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan, Solomon sikhate leh Huram sikhate Ophir a kipan a dangkaeng vapawte’n Algum sing leh suangmantam a hon pua uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kumpipa’n Algum sing Toupa inn leh kumpipa inn umna ding leh lasamite ading a kaihging leh pekging ding in a bawl a: huchibang Judah gam ah tuma lam in a mu ngeikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sheba kumpinu’n a thil a piak simlouh in kumpipa Solomon in a deihdeih a pesam a, huchi in a gam lam ah a heute toh a pai nawnta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in Solomon kiang a kum khat sung a dangkaeng honglut gikdan dangkaeng talent zaguk leh sawmguk leh guk buk ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi ompolhte leh sumsinmite hontawi simhetlouh in: huan, Arabia kumpipa tengteng leh gam ukpate’n Solomon kiang ah dangkaengte, dangkasikte a hontawi sek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kumpipa Solomon in dangkaeng supek in lumlian chi za nih a bawl a, lumlian khat ah dangkaeng sekel za guk a bei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Dangkaeng sukpek in lum za thum a bawl a; lum khat ah dangkaeng sekel za thum a bei a; huaite Lebanon gammang inn ah a koih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan, kumpipa’n Sai hapak mangtutphah thupitak a bawl behlap a, dangka siang ngen in a luan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />mangtutphah a a kaltouhna siksan gukte, mangtutphah toh a zop, dangkaeng khengaknate, a ban ngakna bul ading humpinelkai lim nihte a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Siksan guk langtuak tung ah humpinelkai sawmlehnih ading ua: huchibang koilai gam ah leng a bawl ngeikei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kumpipa Solomon nou tengteng dangkaeng vek ahi a, Lebanon gammang inn a tuium-belsuan tengteng leng dangkaeng siangvek ahi; Solomon damlai in dangkasik bangmah in a simkei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kumpipa’n longhon, Huram sikhate, Tarsis a hohsek kikoppih a nei a, kum thum halzel in, Tarsis longhon in dangkaeng, dangkasik, saiha, zawng leh utongte, a hon pawsek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa Solomon in khovel kumpipa tengteng hauhsakna leh pilna lam ah a khupvek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huchi in Pathian in a lungtang a a koih, a pilna thu ngaikhe ding in, kumpipa tengteng in Solomon a honzuan huthut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kumteng a piak bikhiah nei in dangkasik tuium-belsuan, dangkaeng tuium-belsuan, puante, galvante, gimlimte, sakolte, sabiltungte a pe zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huan, Solomon in Sakol leh kangtalai koihna mun sang li a nei a, huan sakol tungtuangmi sing khat leh sang nih a nei a, huaite kangtalai koihna khuate ah, Jerusalem kumpipa kiangte ah a omsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huchi in lui a kipan a Philistia gam leh Aigupta gam tan a kumpipa tengteng tung ah vai a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jerusalem khua ah Kumpipa’n dangkasikte suang bang mai a tam in a omsak a, sidar singte phaizang a theipite banglel a ngaih in a omsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Solomon ading in sakolte Aigupta a kipan leh gamchih a kipan in a hon lazel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Solomon tanchin dangte a bul a kipan a tawp tanpha in, zawlnei Nathan gelh tanchin bu ah, Silo mi Ahijah genkholhna bu ah, Nebat tapa Jeroboam tungtang thu a zawlnei Jedai kilakna bu ah a tuang kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Solomon in Jerusalem ah Israel mi tengteng tung ah kum sawmli vai a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Solomon bel a pi leh pute kiang ah a ihmu a, a pa David khua ah a vui ua, a sik in a tapa Rehoboam in vai a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Rehoboam bel Sekem khua ah a hoh a; Israelte tengteng Sekem khua ah kumpipa dia bawl ding in a hoh khinta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Nebat tapa Jeroboam in huai thu a zak in, kumpipa Solomon kiang a kipan a taimangna Aigupta gam a omlai a hingal a, Aigupta gam a kipan Jeroboam a hongpai nawn hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi a sawl ua, a va sam ua; huchi in Jeroboam leh Israel tengteng a hongpai ua. Rehoboam kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Na pa’n ka hakkol uh a giksak mahmah a; huaiziak in na pa’n hon zatgimna leh a hakkol giktak ka tung ua a koih hon sukzangsak inla, huchi in nang nna ka sem ding uh” chi’n a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aman a kiang uah, “Ni thum khit chiang in hongpai nawn zaw un,” a chi a, huchi in mipite a ki hemkhia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumpipa Rehoboam in, “Hiai mipite dawnna ding thupha bang ahia n’on hilh ding uh?” chi in, a pa Solomon damlai a Upate kiang ah a dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amau a kiang ah, “Hiai mipite na hehpih a na kipahsak a, a kiang ua thu hoih tata na gen leh tangtawn in na mite ahi ding uh” chi in a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Himahleh, upate hoihsakpih a pom kei a, amah khanvualpih tangvalte, a kiang a omsekte a dong zawsop hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A kiang uah, “Hiai mipite ka kiang a, Na pa’n ka tung ua hakkol a koih honhih zangsak in chi a gen mite ka dawn dan ding hoih bang ahia n’on hilh ding uh?” a chi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A khanvualpih tangvalte’n a kiang ah hiai mipite na pa’n a hakkol uh a hihgik thei mahmah a, nang zaw hon hihzangsak zaw in na kiang a chi mite kiang ah huchi in chi inla, huchi in a kiang uah gen in, “Ka pa kawng sang in ka khutzung a golzaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka pa’n hakkol giktak a hon na pawsak a, ken ahihleh na hakkol uh behlap lai ding ka hi: ka pa’n khetna in nou a honsawi zel a, ken ahihleh aikam a honsawi ding ka hi,” chi in a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in Jeroboam leh mipite tengteng kumpipa’n “Ni thum khit chiang in hong nawn un” a chih bang in ni thum ni’n Rehoboam kiang ah a hoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kumpipa’n amau gumtakin a dawng a, kumpipa Rehoboam in upate thuhilhna a pom kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tangvalte phatsakpih bang in, ka pa’n na hakkol uh a hihgik a, ken huai behlap ding ka hi; ka pa’n khetna in nou a hon na sawi a, ken zaw aikam a nou honsawi ding ka hi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa’n Silo mi Ahijah zang a, Nebat tapa Jeroboam kiang a a thu gensa a kipsak theihna ding in kumpipa’n mite thugen Pathian ziak in a pom kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kumpipa’n a thu uh a pom kei chih Israelte tengteng in a theih un mipite’n, “David ah tantuan bang ahia i neih uh? Jesse tapa ah gouluah ding i neisam kei uh: Israel mite aw, na puanin lamchiat uah pai un: David, na inkuan sung ngaihtuah mai in, chi in kumpipa a dawng uhi.” Huchi in Israel tengteng a puanin lam uah a paita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel suan, Judah gam khua a omte bel a tung uah Rehoboam in vai a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa Rehoboam in nasem dia a chih teiteite heutu Hadoram a sawl a; amah huai Israelte tengteng in suang in a na deng ua, a sita hi. Kumpipa Rehoboam Jerusalem khua a tai tum in a kangtalai ah a tuang pah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in tutan in Israelte David inkawte tung ah a helta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Rehoboam Jerusalem a tun touh in, Israelte dou a, Rehoboam gam la nawn ding in Judah nuai khat leh Benjamin inkawte, mi hangsan chiat telkhiak, nuai khat leh sing giat tak a kaikhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Himahleh Pathian mi Semaiah kiang ah Toupa thu a hongtung a
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Judah gam kumpipa Solomon tapa Rehoboam kiang ah leh Judah gam leh Benjamin gam a Israel mi tengteng kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“ Toupa’n hichi in a chi: na hohtou ding uh ahi kei, na unaute uh dou sam kei un; na inn lam uah pai nawn vek un; hiai keimah hih ahi hi, chi’n gen in” chi in. Huchi in Toupa thu a mang ua, Jeroboam dou ding a a hoh ding uh a kiknawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rehoboam bel Jerusalem khua ah a om a, Judah gam ah kivenna ding in khua a sat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bethlehem khuate, Etam, Tekoa a sata,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bethzur, Soko, Adullam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gath, Maresah, Jip,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Adoraim, Lakish, Azekah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zoreah, Aijalon, Hebron khua; huaite Judah leh Benjamin gam a kulhnei khuate ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in huai kulhte a hihkip a, heutute a koih a, nekding, thau leh uain a sekkhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khoteng ah lum leh tei a koih a, khua kiptak in a bawlchiat hi. Huchi in Judah leh Benjamin gam amah gam a hisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huan, Israel gam tengteng a siampute leh Levite amau gam a kipan chiat in a kiang ah a hong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Levite’n a gam uh leh a omnate uh a pawtsan ua, Judah gam leh Jerusalem ah a hoh uh; Jeroboam leh a tapate’n Toupa adia siampu na semlou ding in a tawpsak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amun sang a ding leh keltal leh bawngnou lim a bawl a ding a siampute a seh zawk ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huan, Israel nam, Toupa Israelte Pathian lam a lungsim awn tengteng in a zui ua, Toupa a pi leh a pute uh Pathian kiang ah kithoih ding in Jerusalem ah a hoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in, Judah gam a kipsak ua, kum thum sung Solomon tapa Rehoboam in a kipsak hi: kum thum sung David leh Solomon lampi a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Rehoboam in David tapa Jerimoth tanu Mahalath zi in a nei a, huai Jesse tapa Eliab tanu Abihail tanu ahi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tapate a neihsak a; Jeush, Semariah leh Zahamte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amah nung in Absalom tanu Maakah a nei a; aman Abijah, Atai, Jiza leh Selomithte a neihsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Rehoboam in Absalom tanu Maakah bel a zite leh a mite tengteng tung ah a it tuan a; zi sawmlehgiat leh mei sawmguk a nei a, tapa sawmnih leh giat leh tanu sawmguk a nei ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Rehoboam in Maakah tapa Abijah bel a unaute lak ah tungnungpen in a bawl a; kumpipa ding a bawl a lungsim ahi zawmah hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Piltak in a gamta a, a tapate tengteng Judah gam leh Benjamin gam tengteng kulhnei khuate ah a om zaksak vek a; nekding tampi a pia a, zi tampi a zonsak chiat hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi a, Rehoboam gam a hon phuhkipa, mi hattak a hong hihnung in amah lam a pang Israel tengteng toh Toupa Dan a lehngatsan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hichi a honghi a, kumpipa Rehoboam vaihawm kum ngana kum in, Toupa tung a a tatlek ziak un, Aigupta kumpipa Sisak Jerusalem sim ding in a hong kuantou hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kangtalai sing khat leh sang nih leh sakol tungtuang mi sing guk toh: Aigupta gammi honzui simvuallouh ahi uh; Lubte, Sukite, Ethiopiate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Judah gam a kulhnei khuate a la a, Jerusalem a vatung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zawlnei Semaiah, Rehoboam leh Judahte intekpen, Sisak ziak a Jerusalem a kikaikhawmte kiang ah a hohtou a, a kiang uah, “ Toupa’n hichi in a chi, n’on lehngatsanta ua, huaiziak in ken leng nou Sisak khut ah k’on koihta ahi a chi” a vachi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in Israel intekpente leh kumpipa a kiniamkhiak ua, “ Toupa a diktat hi” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa’n a kiniamkhiak uh a theih in Toupa thu Semaiah kiang ah a hongtung a, “A kiniamkhiakta ua; ka hihmang vek kei ding a, khenkhat ka humbit ding a, Sisak zang in Jerusalem tung ah ka hehna ka sungbaw kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Himahleh a sikhate ahi ding ua, ka nasep leh gamdang mi nasep dan a theihna ding un” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in Aigupta kumpipa Sisak Jerusalem sim in a paitou a, Toupa inn a goute leh kumpipa inn a goute a la a; a lakhin vek hi; Solomon bawl dangkaeng lumte leng a la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kumpipa Rehoboam in huaite tang in dal lumte a bawl a, kumpipa inn kongkhak ngakmi sepaih heutute a kemsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, kumpipa Toupa inn a lutteng in vengmite’n a vapi ua, amah dantan ah a kha kiknawn zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A kiniamkhiak ziak in hih manthat ahihlouhna ding in a tung a Toupa thangpaihna a kiheimangta a; Judah gam leng a hoih gige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa Rehoboam in a vaihawmna Jerusalem ah a kipsakta hi: Rehoboam a vaihawm pattung in kum sawmli leh kum khat a upa ahi, Toupa’n a min omsakna ding a Israel nam tengteng lak a tel khua Jerusalem ah kum sawmlehsagih vai a hawm a; a nu min Naamah, Ammon mi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa zong dia a lungsim a zatlouh ziak in thil hoihlou a hih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in Rehoboam tanchin a bul a kipan a tawppha in zawlnei Semaiah gelh tanchin bu ah leh zawlnei Iddo gelh tanchin bu a suante tanchin lak a gelh ahi kei maw? Rehoboam leh Jeroboam bel a kidou nilouhlouh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huan, Rehoboam a pi leh pute kiang ah a ihmu a, David khua ah a vui ua: a sik in a tapa Abijah in vai a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jeroboam kum sawmlehgiat a vaihawm kum in Judahte tung ah Abijah in vai a hawm pan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem ah kum thum vai a hawm a, a nu min Mikaiah, Gibeah mi Uriel tanu ahi. Huan, Abijah leh Jeroboam bel a kidou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Abijah in sepaih kidoumi, mi hangsan telkhiak nuai li toh a vasual a, Jeroboam mihat hangsan telkhiak nuai giat in kiphalh in a na dou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Abijah bel, Ephraim singtang gam a om Zemariam mualvum tung ah ading a, “Aw Jeroboam, Israelte tengteng toh na ngaikhia un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa Israelte Pathian in Israel gam David leh a tate kiang a chi a thukhun in tangtawn adin a pia chih thei dia kilawm mahmah hilou na hi uh maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Himahleh Nebat tapa Jeroboam, David tapa Solomon sikha a pu tung ah a hong hel maimah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Rehoboam a naupanglai a, a lungsim a nem lai a, amaute a na nan theihlouh lai in Solomon tapa Rehoboam kalh in mithulimlou Belial tate a kikaikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“David tapa lak ah Toupa gam dou theih na kigingta kei ua: tam leng na tam kuam ua, Jeroboam in pathiante ding a nou a hon bawlsak dangkaeng bawngnou limte leng na kiang uah a omlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa siampu, Aron tapate leh Levite delhkhia in, gamdang mite hihdan bang in siampu na kibawl uh ahi kei maw? Huchi in bawng tuai leh belam sagih a hong kilan peuhmahte pathian hiloupite siampu a hithei zel mawk uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Himahleh kou zaw, Toupa bel ka Pathian uh ahi a, amah ka lehngatsan kei ua: Toupa adia nasemmi amau na chiat sem Aron tapa siampute leh Levite ka nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ni teng leh zan teng in Toupa adin haltum thillatte, gimlimte, a halzel uh, tanghou siah leng dohkan siangthou ah a koih kichian gige uhi. Nitaklam teng a hal ding in dangkaeng khawnvak koihna a khawnvak toh; kou zaw Toupa ka Pathian uh thupiak ka zui gige ua, nou bel amah na lehngatsan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ngai dih ua, Pathian ka ma uh pi in ka kiang uah a om a, a siampute leng a pengkul ua nou hon nawh ding a mut ding in a om uhi. Aw, Israel suante aw Toupa na pi leh pute uh Pathian zaw dou mahmah kei un, na lamzang kei hial ding uhi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Himahleh Jeroboam in a nunglam uah a guktan sak a: huchi in Judahte malam ah a om ua, guktan mite a nunglam uah a om uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Judahte a lehngat uleh a nunglam uah leh a malam uah gal a omta a, Toupa a samta ua, siampute’n pengkul a mut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in Judahte a kikou zuazua ua; huchi a Judah a kikou zuazua ualeh hichi ahi a, Abijah leh Judahte ma ah Toupa’n Jeroboam leh Israelte tengteng a vuallelsakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel suante Judahte ma ah a taikek ua, Pathian in a khut uah a peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in Abijah leh a heute’n amau a that ua: Israel mitel ngen nuai nga a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huai tung in Israel suante vuallelh dan huchibang ahi, Judah suante’n Toupa a pi leh pute uh Pathian a muan ziak un a zouta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huan, Abijah in Jeroboam a delh a, a khuate a laksak a, Bethel a khopelte toh, Jesanah a khopelte toh, Ephron a khopelte toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Abijah vaihawm laiteng in Jeroboam in dinkhiak zohna a nei nawn kei; Toupa’n a gawt a, a sita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Abijah bel a hat deuhdeuh a, zi sawmlehli a nei a, tapa sawmnih leh nih leh tanu sawmlehguk a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Abijah tanchin dangte leh a omdante, a thu gente zawlnei Iddo hilhchetna bu ah a tuang hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in Abijah bel a pi leh pute kiang ah a ihmu a, David khopi ah a vui ua, a sik in a tapa Asa in vai a hawmta: a vaihawm sung in a gam uh kum sawm galmuang in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Asa in Toupa a Pathian mitmuh in thil hoih leh thil dik a hih gige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Gamdang pathian maitamte leh munsangte a lamang a, suangphuhte a hihchim a, Aserah songte a hihtam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Judahte Toupa a pi leh pute uh Pathian zong ding leh a dan leh a thupiak zui ding in thu a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan, Judahte khua tengteng a munsangte leh milimte a lamang vek a; amah nuai ah a gam galmuang in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Judah gam ah kulhnei khuate a bawl a, gam galmuang in a om a, huai kumte in kidouna a neikei a, Toupa’n galmuanna a piak ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Judahte kiang ah, “Hiai khuate bawl phanawn ni e, kulh in um le hang, insangte, kulh kongkhakte, a kalhnate bawl ni: Toupa i Pathian i zon tak ziak un gam i nuai uah a hong omta ahi: amah i zong ua, aman kilchih ningchih a galmuang a omna hon peta ahi” a chi hi. Huchi in a bawlpha ua, a lamzang zelta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Asa in Judah mi lum leh tei tawi mi sepaih nuai thum a nei a: Benjamin mi phaw leh thal zangmi nuai nih leh sing giat; huai tengteng mi hat hangsan vek ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan, Ethiopia mi Zerah, sepaih maktaduai khat leh kangtalai za thum toh amau sual ding in a hong kuan a; Maresah a hongtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in Asa bel sual din a vakuan a, Maresah ah Zephathah guam ah a kiphalh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Asa in Toupa a Pathian a sam a, “ Toupa kia loungal mi hattak lak a hatlou panpih a omkei a; aw Toupa ka Pathian uh, hon panpih ve; nang hon muang in na min in hiai mipite ka hongsual uhi. Aw Toupa , ka Pathian uh na hi a, mihing in nang hon zou kei uhen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa’n Asa leh Judahte ma ah Ethiopia mite a sual a; Ethiopia mite a taikekta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Asa leh a heute’n Gerar tan in a delh ua, Ethiopia mite si a tam mahmah ziak un a pang theikei ua; Toupa leh a sepaihte ma ah vuallelh sak in a omta ua; gallak tampi a la uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Gerar kim a khua tengteng a sual ua, Toupa launa a tung uah a om a, khua tengteng a lok ua, gallak a tam ngial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ganpute puaninte leng a sual ua, belam leh sangawngsau tampi a hawl ua, Jerusalem ah a pai nawnta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Oded tapa Azariah tung ah Pathian kha a hongtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Asa dawn ding in a paikhia a, a kiang ah, “Asa leh Judah mi tengteng leh Benjamin mite aw, ka thu ngaikhe dih ua, a lam a na pan sung teng un Toupa nou lam ah a pang, amah na zon uleh na mu ding ua, amah na lehngatsan uleh aman a hon lehngatsan ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel mite sawtpi Pathian tak neilou leh sinsakmi leh siampu neilou leh dan neilou in a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Himahleh, a mangbat ua Toupa Israelte Pathian lam a ngat ua, a zon tak un a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huailai in a pawt lam leh a lut lamte ading in galmuanna a omkei a, gamsung a om tengteng adin mangbatna thupi mahmah ngen ahizaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nam leh nam, khua leh khua a kihihsia ua, Pathian in haksatna chiteng in a haksasak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh, nou zaw hattak in om unla, kithadah sak kei un, na thilhih man uh na mu ding uhi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in Asa in huai thute leh zawlnei Oded thugente a zak in a kihangsaka, Judah gam leh Benjamin gam tengteng a kipan leh Ephraim tang gam a kholaka kipan a thil kihhuaite a paimang vek a; Toupa inn lim chin a Toupa maitam a bawlpha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Judah gam leh Benjamin gammi tengteng, a kiang a om Ephraim leh Manasseh leh Simeon gam a mite toh a samkhawm vek a: Toupa Pathian a kiang ah a om chih a theih un Israel gam apan in a hong bel vek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in Asa kum sawm leh kum nga a vaihawm kum, a kha thumna ah Jerusalem ah a ki kaikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huai ni’n a gallak uh bawngtal za sagih leh belam sang sagih in Toupa kiang ah a kithoih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A lungsim uh leh a lungtang tengteng un Toupa a pi leh pute uh Pathian zong ding leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kuapeuh Toupa Israelte Pathian zong lou a lian a neu, a numei a pasal in hihlup ding thu a khung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa kiang ah aw ngaihtak a ging in, kikou in, pengkul ging toh, pengkul binei ging toh a kichiam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Judah mi tengteng a kichiamna uah a kipak ua, a lungtang tak ua kichiam a, kituak tak a a hih ziak un, muh leng a mu him ua; huchi in Toupa’n munchih ah galmuang a omna a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kumpipa Asa nu Maakah leng milim kihhuai tak Aserah a bawlsak ziak in a kumpinu hihna a tawpsak a; huchi in Asa in milim a phuk a, a hihzan vek a, Kidron lui ah a hal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Himahleh, Israel gam a kipan munsangte paihmang ahi kei a; himahleh Asa lungsim a vaihawm sung in a kizen gige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Apan thil a lat leh amah latte dangkasik, dangkaeng, tuium-belsuan Pathian inn ah a lalut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Asa vaihawm lai kum sawmthum leh nga sung in kidou himhim a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Asa kum sawmthum leh guk a vaihawm kum in Israel kumpipa Baasha in Judahte a sual a, Judah kumpipa kiang a lut ding leh pawt ding dalna ding in Ramah khua a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in Asa in Toupa inn leh kumpipa inn a gou dangkasik leh dangkaengte a lakhia a, Damaska a Suria kumpipa Benhadad kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ka pa leh na pa kal a thukhun a om bangmah in i kikal ah thukhun a om a, ngai dih, dangkasik leh dangkaengte k’on khak ahi; kisa dih, Israel kumpipa Baasha in a hon tawpsanna ding in a kiang ah na thukhun phel nawn mai in” chi in a khak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in Benhadad in kumpipa Asa thu a na pom a; Israel khuate sual ding in sepaih heutute a sawl a, Ijon khua, Dan khua, Abel maim khua, Naphtali gam a van koihna khua tengteng a sual uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Baasha in huai thu a zak in Ramah khua a bawl lai a khawlsan a, a thilhih tup a kikhelsakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in, kumpipa Asa in Judah mi tengteng a pi a. Baasha in Ramah khua bawlna ding a suang leh sing a zatte a la vek ua, huaite in Geba leh Mizpah khua a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huailai in zawlnei Hanani Judah kumpipa Asa kiang ah a hong a, a kiang ah, “ Toupa na Pathian muang lou in Suria kumpipa na muang a, huaiziak in Suria kumpipa sepaih honte na khahta ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ethiopiate leh Lubte sepaih hon liantak, kangtalai leh sakol tungtuangmite tampi ahi kei umaw? Himahleh Toupa na muan ziak in na khut ah a honpia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A lam a lungsim diktak pumite tung a a hatdan hihlang ding in khovel tengteng ah Toupa mit a vak dundun hi. Haihuai mahmah in thil na hihta a; tuban dou na nei gige ding a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in, Asa bel zawlnei tung ah a heh a, suangkulh ah a khumta a; a thugen ziak in a heh mahmah mai hi. Asa in mi khenkhatte leng a simmawh behlap lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan ngai dih ua, Asa tanchin a bul a kipan a a tawppha in Judah leh Israel kumpipate tanchin gelhna bu ah a tuang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kum sawmthum leh kua a vaihawm kum in Asa bel a khe a hong nata a; a natna thupitak ahi; himahleh a natna ah Toupa zong lou in damdawi siamte a zong zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in Asa bel a pi leh pute kiang ah a ihmu a, kum sawmli leh khat a vaihawm kum in a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />David khopi a amah a tuam dia a hankhuak ah a vui ua, gimlim tak, gimlim bawlmite’n gimlim chi tuamtuam a dim a kibawl lupna ah a sial ua, amah a tuam ding in meikuang thupi mahmah a sem uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A tapa Jehosaphat a sik in a lal a, Israel mite dou ding in a kihihhat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in Judah gam a kulhnei khua tengteng ah sepaih a koih a; Judah gam leh a pa Asa in a na lak Ephraim gam a khuate ah galvilmi a koih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan, Jehosaphat kiang ah Toupa a om a; Baal zong lou a, a pu David in a tot masaksa lampi tawn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A pi leh pute uh Pathian zong a, Israel mite hih bang hihlou a, a thupiakte a zuihzawk ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa’n a gam a khut ah a hihkip a, huchi in Judah gammi tengteng in Jehosaphat kipahman a hongpia ua, a honghau in a thupi hiaihiai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A lungsim Toupa lam ah a awn a; Judah gam a kipan munsangte leh Aserte a phiatmang vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kum thum a vaihawm kum in a mi lian Benhail, Obadiah, Zekariah, Nathanael, Mikaiah, Judah gam khuate a mite sinsak ding in a sawlkhia a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Levi mi, Semaiah, Nethaniah, Zebadiah, Asahel, Semiramoth, Jehonathan, Adonijah, Tobijah, Tobadonijah a teltei ua, siampu Elisama leh Jehoram leng a tel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa danbu a tawi ua, Judah gam ah a sinsak ua, Judah gam khua tengteng a tawn ua, mite a sinsak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in Judah gam leh a kim gam tengteng a mite’n Toupa laudan a siam ua, kuamah in Jehosaphat a dou ngam kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Philistiami khenkhat in Jehosaphat kipahman a hongpia ua, siah ding in dangkasik leng a pelai uh; Arabia mite’n ganhon, belamtal sang sagih leh za sagih leh keltal sang sagih leh za sagih a honkai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in Jehosaphat bel a hong thupi mahmah a, Judah gam ah kulhte leh thil koihkhawmna khuate a bawl a, Judah gam khuate ah nasep tampi a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jerusalem ah sepaih mihat hangsante a hau behlap lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A inkuan kuan ua a omdan uh hichibang ahi: Judah inkuan a sang heutute, heutu Adnah in mihat hangsan nuai thum a heu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A zom Jehohanan in nuai nih leh sing giat a heu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A zom nawn Jikri tapa Amasiah bel kiphaltak a Toupa ding a kipia in, mihat hangsan nuai nih a heu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Benjamin inkuante mihat hangsan Eliada in thal leh lum zang mi nuai nih a heu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Azom Jehozabad in galkap ding a mansiangsa nuai khat leh sing giat a heu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hiai tengteng Judah gam a kulhnei khua a kumpipa’n a koihte simlouh a kumpipa kiang a om gigete ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in Jehosaphat bel a hong hau in a thupi mahmah a, huchi in Ahab toh kizopna a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kum bangzah hiam nung in Samaria ah Ahab kiang ah a hohsuk a, Ahab in amah leh a heute belam leh bawngtalte tampi a na goh a, Ramoth Gilead khua a hoh touhpih ding in a chial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel kumpipa Ahab in Judah kumpipa Jehosaphat kiang ah, “Ramoth Gilead khua ah i hohtou khawm kei dia hia?” a chi hi. Aman a dawng a, “Kei leh nang, ka mite leh na mite pumkhat i hi ua, gal i dou khawm ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jehosaphat in Israel kumpipa kiang ah, “ Toupa thu hungaih phot lai in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in Israel kumpipa’n, zawlneite mi za li a samkhawm a, a kiang uah, “Ramoth Gilead khua sual ding in ka kuan ding uam, kuan lou ding?” a chi hi. Amau “Kuan in, Pathian in kumpipa khut ah a pe ding” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Himahleh Jehosaphat in, “ Toupa zawlnei kuate hiam i dot ding a omkei ua eita aw?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel kumpipa’n Jehosaphat kiang ah, “ Toupa hon dotsak ding mi khat a om hi; himahleh amah bel ka muhdah lamtak ahi; ka tungtang thu a hoihlou lam kia loungal a hoih lam himhim a gen ngeikei a; huai mi bel Imla tapa Mikaiah ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in Israel kumpipa’n heutu khat a sam a, “Imla tapa Mikaiah honpi meng dih” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel kumpipa leh Judah kumpipa Samaria kulh kongpi lutna chin mun awng ah a kumpi puan ua kizem in a mangtutphah tuaktuak uah a tu ua; zawlnei tengteng in a ma uah thu a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kenaanah tapa Zedekiah in sik kite a bawl a, Toupa’n hichi in a chi, “Hiaite in Suriate mangthang sipsip khop in na sual ding a chi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi mah bang in zawlnei dangte’n leng, “Ramoth Gilead ah hoh inla, lamzang in; Toupa’n kumpipa khut ah a pe ding hi” chi in a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mikaiah sam dia a sawlpa un, “Ngai dih, zawlneite’n kithutuak in a hoihlam in kumpipa kiang ah thu a gen chiat ua; huaiziak in nang leng a chihsa bang un a hoihlam in vagen samdih ve” chi’n a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huan, Mikaiah in, “ Toupa hinna lou in ka chi hi, ka Pathian in a chih bang geih in ahi ka gen ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa kiang a tun in kumpipa’n a kiang ah, “Mikaiah Ramoth Gilead khua sual ding in ka kuan ding uam kuan lou ding?” a chi hi. Aman, “Kuan unla, va lamzang un, na khut a piak ahi ding hi,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kumpipa’n a kiang ah, “Thutak keleu lou ka kiang ah Toupa min a genlou ding in bangzahvei ahia nang k’on kichiamsak ding?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aman “Belam chingtu neilou bang in Israel tengteng tang ah dalhzak in ka mu a; Toupa’n , hiaite’n heutu a neikei ua, amau in lam ah lungmuangtak in pai diam uhen a chi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel kumpipa’n Jehosaphat kiang ah, “Ka tungtang thu zaw a selam kia loungal a hoihlam himhim ahihleh a gen sam kei ding chih k’on hilh ahi kei maw?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mikaiah in a gennawn a, “ Toupa thu ngaikhia un, Toupa a mangtutphah a tu, van mipite tengteng a taklam leh a veilam ading ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Toupa’n Israel kumpipa Ahab Ramoth Gilead a vakuana, va si ding a kua’n ahia khem ding? a chih chiang in khat in, ‘Huchi khachi in,’ a chi a, midang in, ‘huchibang khachibangin’ a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kha khat a hongpawt a, Toupa ma ading in, ‘ken ka khem ding,’ a chi hi. Toupa’n a kiang ah, bang in eita? a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aman, ‘ka vahoh ding a, zawlneite tengteng kam ah kha zuauthei in ka vasuak ding,’ a chi hi. Huan aman, na va khem ngei ding a, na lohching ding, kuan inla, huchibang in hih in,’ ” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huchi in ngai dih, Toupa’n “Hiai zawlneite kam ah kha zuauthei a koih a; na tungthu Toupa’n a hoihlou lam in a genta ahi,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huaitak in Kenaanah tapa Zedekiah in a vanaih a, Mikaiah biang ah a beng a, “Na kiang a thugen ding Toupa kha in koilam a hon pawtsan ahia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mikaiah in, “Ngai dih, dantan sunggil a bu ding a na lut ni chiang in n’on thei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huchi in, Israel kumpipa’n, “Mikaiah pi unla, khaw ukpa Ammon leh kumpipa tapa kiang ah paipih nawn un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kumpipa’n hichi in a chi a, ‘hiai mi suangkulh ah khum unla, lungmuangtak a ka hongpai nawn masiah gimthuakna an leh gimthuakna tui pia un,’ a chi a, na chi ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huan, Mikaiah in, “Lungmuangtak a na hongpai nawn peuhmah leh Toupa’n kei honzang a thu genlou a hi ding hi” a chi a, amahmah in, “Nou mipi tengteng in leng na za un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Israel kumpipa leh Judah kumpipa Jehosaphat bel Ramoth Gilead khua ah a vahoh tou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Israel kumpipa’n Jehosaphat kiang ah, “Kei ka kibawl lamdang ding a, kisualna ah ka hoh sam ding; nang zaw na kumpipa puan kisilh in” a chi hi. Huchi in Israel kumpipa bel a kibawl lamdang a, kidouna ah a hoh tou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Suria kumpipa’n a kangtalaite tung a heutute kiang ah, “Israel kumpipa loungal mi neu leng milian leng na sual ding uh ahi kei” chi’n thu a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, “Kangtalai tung a heutute’n Jehosaphat a muh uleh Israel kumpipa eive” a chi ua. Huchi in sual tum in a umta uhi; himahleh Jehosaphat a kikou a, Toupa’n a panpihta a, huchi in Pathian in amau amah a nuse sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Huchi in hichi ahi a, kangtalai tung a heutute’n Israel kumpipa ahi kei chih a theih un delhlou in a kiksan nawnta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mi khat in ngim tuam neilou in a thalpeu a lai a, Israel kumpipa a awmphaw leh a awmphaw kikal ah a kap a, huchi in a kangtalai hawlpa kiang ah, “Leh hawl inla, mipi lak a kipan hon paikhiakpih in, liamna natak ka tuak hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Huai ni’n kisualna a thupi mahmah a; Israel kumpipa bel Suriate lam nga in a kangtalai ah nitaklam tanpha in ading a; huan nitum kuan in a sita hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Jehosaphat bel lungmuangtak in Jerusalem a a inn ah a pai nawnta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in zawlnei Hanani tapa Jehu in a na dawn a, kumpipa Jehosaphat kiang ah, “Migilou na panpih in Toupa haw mite na it ding ahi maw? Hiai ziak in Toupa thangpaihna, na tung ah a hong omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Himahleh hiai gam a kipan Aserah na paimang a, Toupa na zon ziak in hoihna lam banghiam khat na neilai hi,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jehosaphat bel Jerusalem ah a om a; huan Beer–sheba a kipan a Ephraim tanggam pha in a mite lak ah a hoh nawn a, Toupa , a pi leh pute uh Pathian lam ah aman a pi kiknawn vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in khochih ah Judah gam kulhnei khua tengteng ah vaihawmmite a koih a, vaihawmmite kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Na thilhih uh hoihtak a ngaihtuah in hih un, mihing ading a vaihawm na hi kei ua, Toupa ading ahizaw ngal a; vaihawmna ah na kiang uah a tel zel ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huaiziak in, Toupa lau unla, pilvangtak in hih un; Toupa i Pathian ah gitlouhna, khentuam neihna leh golh neknate a omkei” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in Jehosaphat in Jerusalem ah Toupa vaihawm ding leh thubuaite lemmi ding in Levite, siampute, Israel inkaw intekte a koih behlap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“ Toupa laudan siam kawm in muanhuaitak in, lungsim diktak pu in na hih ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Koilai khua a mi in leng thubuai a hong gen ua, tualthah thu, dan leh thupiak thu, thuseh leh vaihawm thute a hong kilan uleh, Toupa tung a thil a hikhelhlouhna ding un amau pilvang in na hilh ding ua, nou leh na unaute uh tung ah thangpaihna a hongtung zenhouh kha ding; huchibang in hih le uchin, mawhsak in na omkei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan, Ngai dih ua, Toupa lam thu tengteng ah siampu lianpen Amariah bel na heutu uh ahi a; kumpipa lam thu tengteng ah Judah inkaw tung a vaihawmmi Ishmael tapa Zebadiah ahi: Levite leng na heutute uh ahi sam ding uh. Hangtak in hih unla, mi hoihte kiang ah Toupa om hen’ ” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huai nung in hichi ahi a, Moab suante leh Ammon suante khenkhat toh Jehosaphat sual ding in a hong kuan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in kuate hiam in Jehosaphat kiang ah, “Nang sual ding in mipi thupi mahmah, tuipi gal Suria a kipan a hong kuan uhi; ngai in, Hazazontamar ah a omta uh, huai bel Engedi leng a chisam uh” chi’n a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jehosaphat a lau a, Toupa zong ding in a kipia a; Judah gam tengteng ah anngawl ding thu a thangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in Judahte bel Toupa panpihna zong in a ki kaikhawm ua; Judah khuachih a kipan Toupa zong ding in a hong pawtkhia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jehosaphat Toupa inn ah, intual thak chin ah Judah leh Jerusalem kikaikhawm lak ah ading a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Aw Toupa ka pi leh pute uh Pathian, van Pathian, van a Pathian na hi ka hia? Namchih tung a vaihawmpa na hi ka hia? Na khut ah thilhihtheihna leh hatna a om a, kuamah zoh vual na hi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw ka Pathian uh, hiai gam a tengte na mi Israelte na delhkhiak sak a, na lawm Abraham suante tangtawn a dia na piak ahi kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hiai gam ah a hong omta ua, na min adin Mun Siangthou a hon lamsak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />‘Ka tung uah thil hoihlou, namsau a vaihawmnate hiam, hite hiam, kialte hiam a hongtun leh hiai inn ma leh nang ma ah k’ong ding ding ua, hiai inn ah lah na min a om ngal a, ka mangbatna uah nang k’on sam ding ua, nang n’on na ngaihkhiak sak in n’on hondam ding,” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Huchi in, ngai in, Ammon suante leh Moabte leh Seir tang a mi, Israelte, Aigupta gam a kipan a hong paikhiak lai un, amau a sim uh na phal kei a, amau a kipan a ki heimang zaw ua, amau a hihmang kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka luah ding ua n’on piak gam a kipan hon delhkhe ding in a hong kuan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw ka Pathian uh, a tung ua vaihawm lou ding na hi maw? Mi huai zahzah hon sual ding a hong kuante lah na sualthei ding dan mahmah ka hi kei ua; a lohna dan ka theikei ua, nanglam ka hong nga zawmai uhi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Judahte tengteng, a nau neu chikchik uh, a zite uh a tate utoh Toupa ma ah ading uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in mipi lak ah Jahajiel tung ah Toupa kha a hongtung a, huai mi Zekariah tapa ahi a, huai mi Benaiah tapa ahi a, huai mi Jeiel tapa ahi a, huai mi Asaph suan Levi mi Mataniah tapa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aman, “Nou Judah gam a mi tengteng leh Jerusalem a teng tengteng leh nang Jehosaphat, na ngaikhia un: Toupa’n na kiang uah hichi in a chi, ‘Lau kei unla, huai mipi thupi mahmahte ziak in leng lunglel sam kei un; kidouna noute kidouna ahi kei a, Pathian kidouna ahizaw ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zingchiang in vasual un; ngai dih ua, Ziz zottouhna ah a hong tou ua, Jeruel gamdai chin guam tawp lam ah na va mu ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hiai kidouna na sual uh a kiphamoh kei ding: kiphalh unla, adin in ding mai unla, nou lam a pang Toupa hotdamna tak en gige un, Judah mite leh Jerusalem mite aw: lau kei unla, lunglel sam kei un, zingchiang in sual ding in kuan un, Toupa lah noulam ah a pang ngal a ” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi in Jehosaphat bel a mai a leisi in a kun a; Judah mite tengteng leh Jerusalem mite tengteng Toupa bia in Toupa ma ah a kun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kohath suan leh Korah suan Levite aw ngaihtak a Toupa Israelte Pathian phat ding in a hongdingta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in zingsangin zingkhang in a thou ua, Tekoa gamdai ah a lut ua; a pailai un Jehosaphat ading a, “Aw, Judah mite leh Jerusalem mite aw, ka thu ngaikhia un; Toupa na Pathian uh ging unla, kiptak in ding unla, a zawlneite gingta unla, lamzangtak in na om ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mipite a hanthawn khit in sepaihte ma a paikawma Toupa pahtawina leh a siangthou kilawm dan phat ding a lasami dingte a sep hi: “Aw Toupa kiang ah kipahthu gen un, a chitna lah tangtawn in a om sin ngal a chi un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huan, la a sak ua a phattak un Ammon suante, Moab suante, tang a mite Judate sual ding a hong kuante guktan ding mite Toupa’n a koih a; a vuallelta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ammon suante leh Moab suante’n Seir tang a omte thah chimih vek leh hihman sipsip tum in a sualta uhi; Seir tang a mite a hihman khit un amau leh amau kihihman tum in a kisual nilouh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Judahte’n gamdai etna mun sang a vatun uleh mipi lam a en ua; ngai dih, misi luang lei ah a puk zengzung a, khat lel leng a suakta kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huchi in Jehosaphat leh a heute gallak la ding in a vahoh ua, a lak uah sum leh paite, puansilhte, suangmantamte a vamu ua, a puak zoh louh khop un a la ua, a tam petmah a, ni thum tak gallak a sek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A ni li ni’n Berakah guam ah a kikhawm ua, huai ah Toupa a pahtawi ua; huaiziak in tutan in huailai mun, Berakah guam a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huchi in Judah mi leh Jerusalem mi tengteng a pai nawn ua Jehosaphat in Jerusalem a nuamsatak a pai ding in a ma uh a kai a; Toupa’n a melmate uh tungthu a nuamsatak a a omsak ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huchi in pekgingte, kaihgingte, pengkulte toh Jerusalem a Toupa inn a tungtou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Toupa’n Israelte melma a sual chih a theih un, gamchih a mite’n Pathian a lauta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huchi in Jehosaphat gam galmuang in a omta a; a Pathian in a kimvel a mite lak a galmuanna a piak ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jehosaphat in Judah tung ah vai a hawmta a; kum sawmthum leh nga a upa a hih in vai a hawm pan a; Jerusalem ah kum sawmnih leh nga vai a hawm a; a nu min Azubah, Silhi tanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Toupa mitmuh a thil hoih hih in a pa Asa lampi pialsan hetlou in a zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Himahleh munsangte paihmang a hi kei a, mipite’n leng a pi leh pute uh Pathian tung ah a lungtang uh a nga tuan sam kei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Huan, ngai dih ua, Jehosaphat thilhih tengteng a bul a kipan a tawppha in Hanani tapa Jehu tanchin gelhnabu ah a tuang a, Israel kumpipate tanchin bu ah a tuang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Huai nung in Judah kumpipa Jehosaphat in Israel kumpipa Ahaziah, thil hoihlou tak a hihsekpa a kithutuahpih hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tarsis lam a pai ding long a bawlkhawm ua, Ezion-geber ah longte a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Huchi in, Maresah mi Dodavah tapa Eliezer in Jehosaphat kiang ah, “Ahaziah na kithuahpih ziak in Toupa’n na thilhih tup a hon hihsiat sakta ahi” a chi hi. Huchi in longte a kise vek ua, Tarsis ah a hoh theikei uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jehosaphat a pi leh pute kiang ah a ihmu a, a pute lak ah a pu David khopi ah a vui uhi. A tapa Jehoram a sik in a lalta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aman unau, Jehosaphat tapate a nei a, Azariah, Jehiel, Zekariah, Azariah, Mikael leh Sephatiah ahi uh. Hiai tengteng Israel kumpipa Jehosaphat tapate vek ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A pa un thil thupitak tak a pia a, dangkasik, dangkaeng, thil mantam pipite, Judah gam a kulhnei khuate toh; himahleh gamte pen Jehoram a pia a, a ta upapen a hih ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in, Jehoram in a pa gamluah in a hong kihihhatta a, a unaute tengteng namsau in Israelte lak a intek tampi toh a that vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jehoram bel kum sawmthum leh nih a upa a hih in vaihawm apan a: Jerusalem ah kum giat vai a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahab inkawte hih bang in Israel kumpipate lampi a zui hi: Ahab tanu zi in a nei hi: huchi in Toupa mitmuh in thil hoihlou tak a hih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh, Toupa’n David inkawte a hihmang nuam kei a, David kiang a thukhun ziak leh amah leh a suante tan a khawnvak neihsak thak a na chiam khit ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amah damlai in Edomte Judahte lak a kipan a hel ua, kumpipa a kibawl tawm ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in Jehoram a sepaih heutute leh a kangtalai tengteng toh a kuan khia a, zan in a kuan a, amau leh kangtalai tung a heutute amau umkual Edomte a sual hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in Edomte tunitan in Judahte lak ah a hel lailai uhi; huailai mah in Libnah khua leng a hel uhi. Toupa , a pi leh pute uh Pathian a lehngatsan ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan, Judah gam tangte ah munsang a bawl a, Jerusalem mite a angkawm sak a, Judahte a pimang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in zawlnei Elijah a kipan a kiang ah lai a hongtung a “ Toupa , na pu David Pathian in hichi in a chi, ‘Na pa Jehosaphat lampite na tawn kei a, Judahte kumpipa Asa lampite leng na zuikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel kumpipate lampi na zui zaw a, Judahte leh Jerusalem a omte Ahab inkuan bang in ang na kawmsak a, na unau, na pa inkuante nang sang a hoihzaw na thahlai ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngai dih, Toupa’n na mite, na tate, na zite, na gante hipi in a gawt ding a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />gilpi natna thupi mahmah na nei ding a, niteng in natna ziak a na ngoi teng a tolhkhiak vek tan in na china ding hi” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in, Ethiopia mite kiang a mi Philistiate leh Arabia te lungsim Jehoram sual ding in Toupa’n a tokthou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in, Judate a vasual ua, a gam uah a lut ua, kumpipa inn a thil tengteng a la vek ua, a tapate, a zite uh leng; a tapa naupangpen Jehoahaz lousiah a tapa dang a nutsiat kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huai nung in Toupa’n hihdam theilouh gilnatna in a gawt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi a, a kum nihna a bei in a natna ziak in a ngoi a pilhkhia khia a, natna mulkimhuaitak in a sita hi. A mite’n a pa meipi a sehsak bang un a sehsak kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A vaihawm tung in kum sawmthum leh nih ahi a, Jerusalem ah kum giat vai a hawm a, kuamah it louh in a si a, David khopi ah kumpipate han lou ah a vui uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in Jerusalem mite’n a tapa naupangpen Ahaziah a sik in kumpipa ding in a bawl ua; a ta upate tengteng, Arab sepaih honte, a panmun ua hongpai mite’n a that khin vek uhi. Huchi in Judah kumpipa Jehoram tapa Ahaziah in vai a hawmta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahaziah in a vaihawm pat tung in kum sawmli leh nih a upa ahi a, Jerusalem ah kum khat vai a hawm a, a nu min Athaliah, Omri tanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman leng Ahab inkawte lampi tot a tawn a; a nu bel thil gilou tak a thuhilhtu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahab inkawte hih bangmah in Toupa mitmuh in thil hoihlou a hih a, a pa sihnung in a siatna ding a thuhilhtu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amah leng a thuhilh un a om a, Ramoth Gilead ah Suria kumpipa Hazael dou ding in Israel kumpipa Ahab tapa Jehoram kiang ah a hoh a, huchi in Suriate’n Jehoram a su liam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Suria kumpipa Hazael a sualna a Ramah a sukliam uh hihdam ding in Jezreel ah a hoh hi. Huchi in Judah kumpipa Jehoram tapa Azariah bel Ahab tapa Jehoram a damlouh ziak in a veh ding in Jezreel ah a kuan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in Ahaziah Jehoram kiang ah a hoh a, a manthatna Pathian hih ahi a; Nimshi tapa Jehu sual ding in Jehoram kiang a a hoh ziak in. Huai mi bel Ahab inkawte hihmang ding a Toupa seh ahi him hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Ahab inkawte hihse ding a a sual lai in Judahte intekte leh Ahaziah na sem a unau tapate a mu a, a that vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahaziah a zong ua, a man ua, Samaria ah a bu ahi, Jehu kiang ah a honpi ua, a that ua; a lungtang tengteng a Toupa zongsek Jehosaphat tapa ahi, a chi ua, a vui in a vuithoh uhi. Huchi in Ahaziah inkawte’n a gam uah thuneihna a neita kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan Ahaziah nu Athaliah in a tapa si chih a zak in a thou a, Judah inkawte kumpipa tengteng a that vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahaziah tapa Joash bel kumpipa tanu Jehosabeath in kumpipa tapa a thahte uh lak a kipan a selmang a, naudonmi toh lupna dantan sung ah a sel hi. Huchi in kumpipa Jehoram tanu Jehosabeath, siampu Jehoiada zi in, Ahaziah sanggamnu ahi, Athaliah muhlouh ding in a selgu a, huchi in a thah in a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A kiang ua teng in Pathian inn ah kum guk a guk in a kibu a; huchi in Athaliah in a gam uah vai a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A kum sagih kum in Jehoiada a kihatsak a, sepaih zaheutu, Jehoram tapa Azariah, Jehohanan tapa Ishmael, Obed tapa Azariah, Adaiah tapa Maaseiah, Jikri tapa Elisaphath kiang ah thu a khung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in Judah gam ah a vak ua, Judah gam khochih a Levite leh Israel inkuan intekte a kaikhawm ua, Jerusalem a vatung tou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kikaikhawmte tengteng in Pathian inn ah kumpipa kiang ah thu a khung uhi. Huan a kiang uah, “Ngai dih ua, Toupa’n David tapate tungtang thu a na gen bang in kumpipa tapa in vai a hawm ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na hih ding uh hichibang ahi, siampute leh Levite khawlni a hong kuansekte seh thum a khen seh khat kongkhak ngakmite na hi ding ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Seh thum a khen seh khat kumpipa inn ah na om ding ua; huan seh thum a khen seh khat kulh kongpi ah; mipi tengteng bel Toupa intual sung ah a om ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Himahleh, siampute leh nasemmi Levite kia loungal kuamah Toupa inn ah lut kei un, amau bel a siangthou ziak un a lut ding ua, mipi tengteng bel Toupa hungaih in a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Levite’n a galvan uh tawi in kumpipa a um ding ua; kuapeuh inn a honglut thah ding ahi a; huan kumpipa a pawt leh a lut in amah kiang ah om zel un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in Levite leh Judah tengteng in siampu Jehoiada thupiak bang in a hih ua; amaute heute chiat khawlni a hong kuan dingte leh khawlni a tawp dingte a pi ua; siampu Jehoiada in a tawp ding pawl lah a tawpsak naikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Siampu Jehoiada in sepaih za heutute Toupa inn a om kumpipa David tei leh lum neu leh lum liante a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan, mite galvan tawichiat in taklam sang a kipan in veilam sang tan in maitam leh inn um in kumpipa a umsak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa tapa a hon pikhia ua, lallukhu a khusak ua, theihsakna thu a pia ua, kumpipa in a bawl ua, Jehoiada leh a tapate’n thau a nilh ua, “Pathian in kumpipa hondam hen” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Athaliah in mipi kumpipa pahtawi a kiphu motmot husa uh a zak in Toupa inn ah mipi lak ah a vahoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A en a, ngai in, kongpi a khuambul ah kumpipa ading a, a kiang ah sepaih heutute leh pengkul mutmite toh; huai gam a mi tengteng in nuam a sa mahmah ua, pengkulte a mut zuazua ua; lasa mite’n a thil gingtheite uh tum in phatna la a sa khawm uh. Huchi in Athaliah in a puante a botkek a, “Gamdouna; gamdouna ahi ve” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan, Siampu Jehoiada in sepaihte tung a heutu dia seh sepaih za heutute a pikhia a, a kiang uah, “Sepaihte kikal ah pawtsak unla, huan kuapeuh a zuizui namsau a satlup hi hen” a chi hi. siampu in “ Toupa inn ah zaw thah ding a hi kei hi” a chita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in lampi a awn ua, sakol lutna kongpi ah kumpipa inn ah a hoh a, huai ah a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huan, Jehoiada in amah leh mipi tengteng leh kumpipa kikal ah Toupa mite hi ding in thu a khung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mipi tengteng Baal inn ah a hoh ua, a hihsia ua, a maitamte, a limte a hihtam dimdem ua, Baal siampu Matan, maitam bul ah a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jehoiada in, Mosi Danbu a gelh bang a nuamsatak leh lasa kawm a, David in Toupa inn a Toupa kiang a haltum thillat lan ding a a naseh siampu Levite nuai a sem ding in David thupiak bang in Toupa biakin ngakmi dingte a sep hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Siangthou lou peuhmah a lutlouhna ding un Toupa inn kongkhak ngak mite a sep hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huan, za tung a heutute, mi hoihte, mipi ukmite, huai gam mi tengteng a pi a, Toupa inn a kumpipa a pikhia ua; kongkhak saknung zaw ah kumpipa in lam ah a hoh ua, kumpipa a gam mangtutphah ah a tusakta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchi in, Athaliah namsau a a thah nung un huai gam a mi tengteng nuamsatak in a om ua, khopi galmuang in a omta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Joash bel a vaihawmpat tung in kum sagih a upa ahi; Jerusalem ah kum sawmli vai a hawm a; a nu min Jibiah, Beer–sheba mi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Joash in siampu Jehoiada damsung in Toupa mitmuh in thil hoih a hih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jehoiada in amah zi nih a guan a, tapa leh tanute a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi a, huai nung in Joash in Toupa inn bawl phat lungsim in a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Siampute leh Levite a kaikhawm a, “Judate khuate ah hoh unla kum teng a na Pathian inn uh bawl phatna ding in Israel mi tengteng kiang ah sum leh pai khonkhawm unla, zekai kei un” a chi hi. Himahleh Levite a kintat tuankei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in, kumpipa’n siampu lianpen Jehoiada a sam a, a kiang ah, “Bangdia Levite Toupa sikha Mosi leh Israel mipite seh theihsak a puanin adia thoh bikhiah seh Judah mi leh Jerusalem mite thoh ding a phutlou na hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Migilou nu Athaliah tapate’n lah Pathian inn a hihse khinta ua, huan, Toupa inn a thillat tengteng Baalte a pekhin behlap lai uhi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in, kumpipa’n thu a pia a, bawm a bawl ua, Toupa in kongpi pawlam ah a koih ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gamdai a Pathian sikha Mosi in Israel mite hihding a thoh bikhiah a seh Toupa ding a thoh ding in Judah gam tengteng leh Jerusalem ah thu a thangsakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in miliante leh mipite a kipak ua, a dangkate uh a honla ua, a khon khit masiah uh bawm ah a hong koihkoih mai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Levite’n kumpipa upate kiang a bawm a hontawi ua, dangka tampi a om chih a theih un kumpipa Laigelhmi leh siampu kumpipa seh upa in bawm a kipan a bung khia a, a la ua, a mun ah a koih nawn uh. Huchibang in ni teng in a hih ua, dangka tampi a kholkhawmta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kumpipa leh Jehoiada in Toupa inn nasem mite khut ah a pia ua, Toupa inn bawlpha ding in suang sekmite, khutsiamte, Toupa inn bawlpha ding in sik leh dal a khutsiamte leng a guai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in, nasemmite’n a sem pan ua, a sem hoih mahmah ua, Pathian inn a ngei bang geih in a bawlpha ua, ading kip nawnta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A zoh un dangka omlai teng kumpipa leh Jehoiada kiang ah a hontawi ua, huai in Toupa inn a nasepna ding a tuium belsuante, latna tuium-belsuan, sikkeute leh dangkasik tuium belsuante nangawn a bawl uhi. Huchi in Jehoiada damsung in Toupa inn ah haltum thillat a lan gige uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jehoiada bel upa pi tekkun a dam in a sita. A sih in kum za leh sawmthum a upa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in Israelte lak ah Pathian tung ah leh a inn tungtang a thil a hihhoih ziak in David khopi ah kumpipate lak ah a vui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jehoiada sih nung in Judah miliante a hong kuan ua, kumpipa kiang ah toukaina a bawl ua, Kumpipa’n a thu uh a na pom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Himahleh a pi leh pute uh Pathian Toupa inn a lehngatsan ua, Aserte leh milimte na a semta uhi: huchi in, a khelhna uh ziak in Judate leh Jerusalem tung ah thangpaihna a hongtungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Himahleh Toupa kiang a pikik ding in a kiang uah zawlneite a sawl a, a mawhdante uh a theisak ua, himahleh a bil uh a doh nuam kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Siampu Jehoiada tapa Zekariah tung ah Pathian kha a hongtung a, amah mipi tunglam ah ading a, a kiang uah, “Pathian in hichi in a chi, Bangdia lamzan theihlouh loh a Toupa thupiak hihsia na hi ua? Toupa na lehngatsan ziak un aman leng nou a hon lehngatsan ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchi in amah a sawmta ua, kumpipa thupiak in Toupa biakin huangsung ah suang in a deng lumta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huchibang in kumpipa Joash in a pa Jehoiada hehpihna theigige lou in a tapa a thatta hi. A sih kuan in, “ Toupa’n a hon ngaihtuah ding a, phu a hong laksak ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi a, kum a bei in Suria sepaihte’n a hongsual ua; Judah gam leh Jerusalem ah a lut ua, a milian tengteng uh a hihman sak ua, Damaska kumpipa kiang ah gallak tengteng a khakvek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Suria sepaihte bel tawmchik kia a hong kuan ua; a pi leh pute uh Pathian Toupa a lehngatsan ziak un Toupa’n sepaih tampite a khut uah a pia ahi. Huchibang in Joash tung ah gawtna a tung sak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A paisan nung un, natna thupitak thuak in a paisan ua, amah mite ngei in siampu Jehoiada tapate sisan ziak in a sawm ua, a lupna a lum lai a that ua, a sita hi: David khopi ah a vui ua, himahleh kumpipate han ah a phum kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hiaite amah sawmmite ahi uh: Ammon mi Simeath tapa Zabad leh Moab mi Simrith tapa Jehozabad.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huchi in a tapate tung ah thute, a tung a puakgik tak puaksak tungtang thute; Pathian in a bawlphat tungtang thute, ngai dih kumpipa tanchin hilhchianna bu ah gelh ahi. Huan, a sik in a tapa Amaziah in vai a hawmta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amaziah bel a vaihawmpat tung in kum sawmnih leh nga a upa ahi a, Jerusalem ah kum sawmnih leh kua vai a hawm a; a nu min Jehoaddan, Jerusalem mi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa mitmuh in thil hoih a hih a, himahleh a lungsim a pe bukim kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in, hichi a honghi a, a gam a hong dinkip in a pa that, sikhate a that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Himahleh a tate uh a that kei a, Mosi Dan laibu a tuang, “Tate ziak in pate a si ding uh ahi kei, pate ziak in tate a si ding uh ahi sam kei, michih amau gitlouhna ziak in a si ding uh ahi” chi a Toupa’n thu a piak bang in a hih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaziah in Judahte a kaikhawm a, Judah leh Benjamin mi tengteng a inkuan uh dungzui zel in sang heutu leh za heutute nuai ah a omsak hi.Kum sawmnih tunglam teng a sim a, mi teltuam, tei leh lum tawi thei, galkapthei mi nuai thum a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan, Israel gam a mi, mi hat hangsan nuai khat dangka talent za in a guailai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh, a kiang ah Pathian mi, mi khat a hong a, “Aw Kumpipa, Israel sepaihte na kiang ah pai kei le uh, Toupa Israel mite, Ephraim suante huam in, na kiang ah a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hoh hile chin leng, hangtak in kidouna ah gamtang in: huchilou in zaw Pathian in melma mai ah nang a hon vuallel sak ding: Pathian in lah panpih theihna leh vuallelhsak theihna a nei ngal a,” a hong chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in, Amaziah in Pathian mi kiang ah, “Ahihleh Israel sepaihte ka piaksa talent za bang i chih ta dia awi?” a chi a. Huan, Pathian mi’n, “ Toupa’n huai sang a tampi nang a honpe thei ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in Amaziah in Ephraim gam a kipan a sepaih hongpaite paikik ding in a khen a; huaiziak in Judate tung ah a heh mahmah ua, heh mahmah in a paikikta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amaziah in lunglellou in mite a pikhia a, Chi Guam ah a hoh ua, Seir suante sing khat a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sing khat dang Judate’n a hingmat ua, suangpi vum ah a pi ua, suangpi vum a kipan in a sawnkhe mengmeng ua, a kitam zan gawp uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Himahleh Amaziah in a kiang ah galkap ding a pailou ding a a sawlkik sepaihte’n Judah gam khuate, Samaria a kipan a Bethhoron pha in a sual ua, mi sang thum a that ua, gallak tampi a la uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in, hichi ahi a, Amaziah Edomte that a hongpai in Seir suante pathiante a honpua a, a pathian ding in a pangsak a, a bia ua, gimlimte a halsak chiat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huaiziak in Amaziah tung ah Toupa hehna a kuangta a, a kiang ah zawlnei a sawl a, huai min a kiang ah, “Na khut a kipan a a mite honkhe thei lou nam pathiante bangding mahmah a zong na hia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in, hichi ahi a, a kiang a thu a genlai in kumpipa’n, “Kumpipa vaihawmpa ding in nang konbawl ua hia? Dai mai in: bang ding a na hinna tan ding na hia?” a chi a. Huchi in zawlnei in, “Pathian in hichibang a na hih ziak leh ka thuhilhna na ngaihkhiak louh ziak in nang hihmang lungsim in a nei chih ka thei hi, a chi a” a daita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in, Judah kumpipa Amaziah in a thuhilh a pom a, Israel kumpipa Jehu tapa Jehoahaz tapa Joash kiang ah, “Hong dih, kimatuah in i ki en ding” chi’n mi a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Israel kumpipa Joash in Judah kumpipa Amaziah kiang ah, Lebanon tang a sidar sing kiang ah, “Na tanu ka tapa zi ding in nei sak dih” chi’n a thukhak a; huan, Lebanon tang a gamsa a hongpai a, ling a hong chil pukgawp mai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />‘Nang ngai dih, Edom ka zou,’ na chi a, na lungsim in na kisa thei a, na inn ah om kinken mai in; nang leh Judah gam nangawn a siatna, nang dia poi ding thil bangdia tokkhe ding na hia?” chi’n mi a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Himahleh, Amaziah in a ngaikhe nuam kei a; Edomte pathiante a zon ziak a, Judah gam a a melmate uh khut a a piaktheihna ding a Pathian hih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchi in, Israel kumpipa Joash a hohtou a; Judah kumpipa Amaziah toh Judah gam Beth-shemesh khua ah kimaituah in a ki enta ngei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huan, Judate tan Israelte sang in a hongse zaw a; michih amau inlam chiat ah a paita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Israel kumpipa Joash in Judah kumpipa, Ahaziah tapa Jehoahaz ta Amaziah bel Beth-shemesh ah a man a, Jerusalem ah a pi a, Jerusalem kulh Ephraim kulh kongpi a kipan a kulh ning kongpi tan in tong za li tak a chimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huan, Toupa inn leh kumpipa inn a gou koihkhawmna a dangkaeng leh dangka leh tuium-belsuan om tengteng a la a, hen a kawltang dingte toh, huan, Samaria kholam ah a pai nawnta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huchi in, Judah kumpipa Joash tapa Amaziah bel Israelte kumpipa Jehoahaz tapa Joash sih nung in kum sawmlehnga a damlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amaziah thilhih dangte a bul apan a tawptan in ngai dih, Judah kumpipa leh Israel kumpipate vaihawm lai thugelhna bu ah a tuang kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huchi in, Amaziah in Toupa zuih a tawpsan tak in Jerusalem ah thah a sawm ua, Lakish khua ah a tai a; himahleh khua ah mi a delhsak ua, huai ah a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A luang sakol in a pua ua, a pi leh pute kiang ah Judah khopi ah a vui uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in, Judah mi tengteng in kum sawmlehguk a upa Uzziah a pi ua, a pa Amaziah sik in kumpipa ding in a bawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aman kumpipa a pi leh pute kiang a a ihmut nung in Eloth khua a bawlpha a, Judah gam ah a pang sak nawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Uzziah bel a vaihawmpat tung in kum sawmlehguk a upa ahi a, Jerusalem ah kum sawmnga leh nih vai a hawm a, a nu min Jekoliah, Jerusalem mi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A pa Amaziah thilhih bangbang hih sam in Toupa mitmuh in thil hoihtak a hih zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian kilakna theisiam Zekariah damsung in Pathian zong ding in a kibawl chinten hi. Pathian a zon sung teng in Pathian in a lamzang sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Philistiate sim ding in a kuan khia a, Gath kulhte, Jabneh kulh, Ashdod kulh a hihchim a; huchi in Ashdod gam ah leh Philistiate lak ah khua a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in, Pathian in Philistiate lak ah leh Gurbaal a om Arabiate leh Meunimite lak ah a panpih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ammonte’n Uzziah lak ah siah a liau sek ua; huchi in a honghat mahmah ziak un Aigupta gam tan in a min thangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Uzziah in Jerusalem ah a ning ah kongpi, guam kongpi, kulh kawina lai kongpi, insangte, a lamlai a, kulh in a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gamdai ah leng insang a lam a, gam tampi a neih ziak in tuilehte a toukhia a, phailam leh phaizang ah ganhon a nei hi; lou neimite leh uain sukmite tanglam leh gam hoihte ah a koih a, amah louma lam limsakmi tak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Uzziah in sepaih kidou mi kumpipa sepaih heutu Hanani nuai a mi Laigelhmi Jeiel leh heutu Maaseiahte’n a seh bangzel ua a pawlpawl a galkap mi a neilai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihat hangsan chiat, a inkuan upate tengteng sang nih leh za guk ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A nuai uah sepaih sin siamsa ngen nuai thum leh sang sagih leh za nga melma lak a kumpipa panpihmi galsualmi taktak a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in, Uzziah in sepaih tengteng adin lum, tei, siklukhu, sikpuanak, thalpeu leh vaisuanglot adin suangte a kisakhol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jerusalem ah mipilte theihkhiak khawlte a bawl a insang leh kulh ning chih ah thalkapna leh suang lian kuamkuam a na denna ding a koih a; a min gamchih mualchih ah a thangta a; a hat mahmah tan inn a lam a lamdangtak a panpih in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Himahleh a honghat nung in a lungsim a hongsang a, hoihlou hial in thil a hih a, Toupa a Pathian tung ah thil a hihkhial a; gimlim maitam a gimlim hal ding in Toupa biakin ah a lut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in, siampu Azariah in a zui a, mihangsan tak Toupa siampu sawmgiat a tel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kumpipa Uzziah a khou ua a kiang ah, “Uzziah aw, Toupa ding a gimlim hal na hih ding ahi kei hi, gimlim hal ding a sehtuam Aron tapa siampute hih ding ahizaw hi; Mun Siangthou a kipan pawtkhia in; thil na hihkhial hi; Toupa Pathian lak a na thupina ding ahi kei hi,” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huan, Uzziah a hehta a; gimlim halna ding meilakna a tawi hi, huchi a siampute tung a a heh laitak in Toupa inn ah, gimlim halna chin ah siampute ma ah a tal a hong phakkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in, siampu heutu Azariah leh siampu tengteng in a en ua, ngai in, a tal a hongphak a, huai a kipan in a vikkhe pah ua, ahi, Toupa’n a gawt ziak in amah leng kintak in a pawt kheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kumpipa Uzziah bel a sih ni tan in a phakta a, a phak ziak in a inn tuam ah a omta hi: Toupa inn a kipan hihkhiak in a omta a, huchi in a tapa Jotham bel a gam ua mite vaihawm in kumpipa inn a ukpa ding in a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Uzziah thilhih dang tengteng bel a bul a kipan a a tawppha in Amoz tapa zawlnei Isai in a gelh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huchi in, Uzziah bel a pi leh a pute kiang ah a ihmu a, kumpipa a kivuina mun a a pi leh a pute lak ah a vui uhi. “Amah zaw phak ahi ngal a” a chi ua: huchi in, a tapa Jotham in a sik in vai a hawmta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jotham bel a vaihawmpat tung in kum sawmnih leh nga a upa ahi a, Jerusalem ah kum sawmlehguk vai a hawm a: a nu min Jerushah, Zadok tanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A pa Uzziah thilhih bangbang hih in Toupa mitmuh in thil hoih a hihzel hi. Toupa biakin ah bel a lut kei hi. Himahleh mite’n hoihlou tak in a na hih gige uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa inn a kongkhak saknung zaw a bawl a, huan, Ophel kulh tung ah inn tampi a lam behlap lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huan, Judah tanggam ah khuate a bawl a, gamnuai ah inn thupi taktakte, insangte a lamlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in, Ammon suante’n kumpipa a dou ua, a zou hi. Huchi in, Ammon suante’n huai kum in dangka talent za leh huit buh puak sing khat leh barli buh puak sing khat a pia uhi. Huchibang mah in Ammon suante’n a kum nihna leh a kum thumna ah leng a pia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in Jotham in Toupa a Pathian ma a lampi hoih a bawl ziak in a hong hatta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jotham thilhih dangte a galdoute, a omdante ngai dih, Israel leh Judah kumpipate tanchin gelhna bu ah a tuang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A vaihawm pat tung in kum sawmnih leh nga a upa ahi a, Jerusalem ah kum sawmlehguk vai a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jotham bel a pi leh pute kiang ah a ihmu a, David khopi ah a vui uhi: a tapa Ahaz in a sik in vai a hawmta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahaz bel a vaihawmpat tung in kum sawmnih a upa ahi a; Jerusalem ah kum sawmlehguk vai a hawm a: a pu David bang in Toupa mitmuh in thil hoih a hih kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel kumpipate lampi a zui zaw a, Baalte a di’n milim suntawmte a bawl lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinnomtapa guam ah gimlimte a hal a, Toupa’n Israel suante ma a delhkhiaksa namte thil kihhuaitak a hihsek bang un a tate uh mei ah a lut sak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mun sangte, tangte, sing hing nuaite ah a kithoih a, gimlimte a hal zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huaiziak in, Toupa a Pathian in Suria kumpipa khut ah a pia a; a sual ua, a mi tampi sal in a pi ua, Damaska ah a paipih uhi. Israel kumpipa khut a piak ahi lai a, aman tampi a that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A pi leh pute uh Toupa Pathian a lehngatsan ziak un. Remaliah tapa Pekah in Judah gam ah nuai khat leh sing nih ni khat in a that a, avek un mi hangsan chiat ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ephraim mi hat Jikri in kumpipa tapa Maaseiah leh inn sung upa Azrikam leh Elkanah, kumpipa zom a that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in, Israel suante’n a unaute uh nuai nih, numeite, a tapate uh, a tanute uh sal in a pi ua; gallak tamtak a laksak lai ua, gallak pen Samaria ah a tun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huai ah Toupa zawlnei a na om a, a min Obed ahi; Samaria a hongpai ding sepaihte a vaidawn a, a kiang uah, “Ngai dih uh, Toupa na pi leh pute uh Pathian Judahte tung ah a heh a, na khut ua honpia eive, heh a na thahna un van a suntou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Judah leh Jerusalem mite sikhanu leh sikhapa a bawl na tum ua: himahleh noute ngei in leng Toupa na Pathian uh tung ah na hihkhial uh ahi kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huaiziak in, ka thu pom unla, na unaute uh sal a na matte uh paisak nawn un; Toupa hehna thupitak na tung uah a om hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in Ephraimte heutu khenkhat, Johanan tapa Azariahte, Mesillemoth tapa Berekiahte, salum tapa Jehizkiah, Hadlai tapa Amasa kidouna a kipan a hongpaite a na khelh ua, a kiang uah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Salte n’on pilut ding uh ahi kei: ka khelhna uh leh ka tatlekna uh behlap in, Toupa tung ah tatlekna n’on tungsak ding uh ahi, ka khelhna uh a thupi mahmah ngal a, Israel mite tung ah hehna thupitak a om hi” a na chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in sepaihte’n miliante leh mipi ma ah salte leh gallak sumte a nusia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan, minloh louhte a hong thou ua, salte a pi ua, gallak thil in vuaktang a om teng puansilh a guan ua, a van ua, khedapte a bunsak ua, nekding leh dawn ding a pia ua, sathau a nilh ua, a hatloute tengteng sabiltung ah a tuangsak ua, tumsing khua, Jeriko ah a unaute uh kiang ah a paisakta ua: amau Samaria ah a kik nawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huailai in kumpipa Ahaz in Assuria kumpipate panpihna ngen ding in mi a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Edomte’n Judahte a vasual ua, sal dia hon mat thuk ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Philistiate’n leng phailam khuate leh Judah simte a hongla ua, Beth-shemesh, Aijalon, Gederoth, Soko leh a khopelte toh, huan, Timnah leh a khopelte, Gimzo leng a khopelte toh a la ua, huai ah a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel kumpipa Ahaz ziak in Toupa’n Judahte a vuallelsak hi: Judahte tung ah thanghuaitakin thil a hih a, Toupa tung ah nakpitak in a khial ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in, Suria kumpipa Tilgath pilneser a kiang ah a hongpai a, hihhat naksang in a hih mangbang zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahaz in Toupa inn, kumpipa inn leh miliante apan thilte a la a, Suria kumpipa a pia a; himahleh a phatuam tuankei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A mangbat laitak in leng hiai kumpipa Ahaz in Toupa tung ah thil a hihkhial semsem mawk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amah sual mi Damaskate pathian kiang ah a kithoih hi; “Suria kumpipate pathian in amau a panpih ziak in keileng a hon panpih theihna ding in a kiang ah ka kithoih ding ahi” a chi hi. Himahleh amah leh Israel mi tengteng siatna ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huchi in, Ahaz in Pathian inn a tuium-belsuan a kaikhawm vek a, Pathian inn a tuium-belsuan a hihkham vek a, Toupa inn kongkhakte a khak bikbek a; Jerusalem ning chih ah maitam a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Judah khaw tampi ah pathian dangte dia gimlim halna munsangte a bawl a, Toupa a pi leh pute Pathian a hehsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A thilhih dangte tengteng leh a omdan tengteng a bul a kipan a tawppha in ngai dih, Judate leh Israel kumpipate tanchin bu ah a tuang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahaz bel a pi leh pute kiang ah a ihmu a, Jerusalem khopi ah a vui ua; Israel kumpipate han ah a koih kei uhi: huchi in, a tapa Hezekiah in a sik in vai a hawmta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hezekiah in kum sawmnih leh nga a upa a hih in vai a hawm pan a; Jerusalem ah kum sawmnih leh kua vai a hawm a; a nu min Abijah, Zekariah tanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aman a pu David thilhih hih in Toupa mitmuh in thil hoih a hih zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman a vaihawmpat kum kha khatna ah Toupa inn kongkhakte a hong a, a zem hoih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Siampute leh Levite a pilut a, suahlam sang mun za lai ah a pikhawm a, a kiang uah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Nou Levite aw, ka thu ngaikhia un; noute kihihsiangthou phot unla, huchi in Toupa , na pi leh pute uh Pathian inn hihsiangthou unla, Mun Siangthou a kipan ninte paikhia un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />I pi leh pute un thil a hihkhialta ua, Toupa Pathian mitmuh in thil hoihlou a na hih ua, a na lehngatsan ua, Toupa omna a lehngatsan ua, a na nungngatta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Inlim kongkhakte a khak ua, khawnvakte a hihmit ua, Israelte Pathian Mun Siangthou ah gimlimte a hal kei ua, haltum thillatte leng a lan kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa hehna Judate leh Jerusalem tung ah a om a, na mit ua na muh bang un, gamchih mualchih a sepsep ding leh lamdangsak ding leh nuihzat ding in a nabawlta ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngai dih ua, i pi leh pute uh namsau a vuallelh sak in a om ua, i tanu leh i tapate uh, i zite uh, huaiziak in sal in a na om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngai dih ua, a hehna mahmah a then theihna ding in Toupa Israelte Pathian kiang ah thu khun ka tum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka naute aw donlou in omkei un, Toupa na sem na hi ua, a ma a nasem a om ding leh gimlim halmi ding in nou a hon telta ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in Levi mi Amasai tapa Mahathte, Kohath mi Azariah tapa Joelte; Merari tapate lak a Abdi tapa Kiste, Jehallelel tapa Azariah, Gershon, Jim tapa Joahte, Joah tapa Edente,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Elizaphan tapate lak a mi Simri leh Jeuelte: Asaph tapate lak a mi Zekariah leh Mataniahte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Heman tapate lak a mi Jehuel leh Simeite; Jeduthun tapate lak a mi Semaiah leh Ujielte a kuan khia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A unaute uh a samkhawm ua, a kihihsiangthou ua, Toupa thu a kumpipa thupiak bang a Toupa inn hihsiang ding in a lut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in, siampute kihihsiang ding in Toupa inn sunggil lam ah a lut ua, Toupa biakin a thilnin a muh tengteng uh Toupa inkong ah a lakhia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kha khatna ni khat ni’n apan ua, huai kha ni giat ni’n Toupa inlim a tung ua; huchi in ni giat in Toupa inn a hih siangthou ua; kha khatna, ni sawmlehguk ni’n a zouvek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa Hezekiah kiang ah kumpipa inn ah a lut ua, “ Toupa inn a haltum thillatna maitamte, huai a tuium-belsuan tengteng, tanghou siahna dohkante, huai a vanzat tengtengte ka hihsiang vekta uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kumpipa Ahaz in a vaihawm lai a thil a hihkhelh a, a paihmang tuium-belsuan tengteng leng ka bawl zou vek ua, ka hihsiangthou lai ua; huan, ngai dih, Toupa maitam ma lam ah a om hi” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa Hezekiah bel zingkhang in a thou a, khua a miliante a samkhawm a, Toupa inn ah a hoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Gam, Mun Siangthou leh Judate ading a khelh thoihna ding bawngtal sagih, belamtal sagih, belamnou sagih leh keltal sagih a kai tou ua. Aron tapa siampute Toupa maitam a lan ding in thu a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huchi in bawngtalte a gou ua; siampute’n sisan a la ua, maitam a theh ua: belamtalte a gou ua, a sisan in maitam a theh ua; belamnoute leng a gou ua, a sisan in maitam a theh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huan, keltalte khelh thoihna ding in kumpipa leh mipite kiang ah a hon kai ua, a tung uah a khut uh a nga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Siampute’n a gou ua, Israel mi tengteng ading a lemna bawlna ding in a sisan un maitam ah khelh thoihna a lan ua: Kumpipa’n a thupiak bang in Israel mi tengteng ading in a lan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huchi in, David leh kumpipa zawlnei Gad leh zawlnei Nathan thupiak bang in Toupa inn ah Levite dakkhutbette, pekgingte, kaihgingte tum ding in a koih a; thupiak a zawlneite zang a Toupa piak lah a hingal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Levite bel David bawl tumging chi toh ading ua, siampute pengkul toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huan, Hezekiah in maitam a haltum thillat lan ding in thu a pia a. Halmang thillat a hon lat pat un Toupa la pengkul leh Israel kumpipa David bawl tumging toh a honsa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huchi in, mipite’n Pathian a bia ua, la siamte’n la a sa ua, pengkul mutmite’n a mut ua, haltum thillat latkhit masiah huchibang in a hih nilouh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thillat a latkhit un kumpipa leh a kiang a om tengteng in kun in Pathian a bia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kumpipa Hezekiah leh miliante’n Levite bel David leh zawlnei Asaph phuahphatna lasa ding in thu a pia uhi. Huchi in, nuamsatak in phatna la a sa ua, a kun ua, Pathian a bia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Huchi in Hezekiah in, “ Toupa ading in na kihihsiangthouta ua, hong nai unla, Toupa inn ah kithoihna leh kipahthu genna thillat honglan un” a chi hi. Mipite’n kithoihnate, kipahthugenna thillatte a honlan ua: a utut in haltum thillat a hon lan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mipite’n haltum thillat a honglat zah uh bawngtal sawmsagih leh belamtal za leh belamnou za nih ahi: hiaite tengteng Toupa adia haltum thillat ding vek ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Thillat tengteng bawngtal za guk, belamtal sang thum ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Himahleh siampu a tawmlua ua, haltum thillat pen a sem seng kei ua; huaiziak in a unaute Levite’n a kimansak ma un siampute a kihihsiangthou tan in a huh uhi: Levite siampute sang in kihihsiangthou thu ah a ngentel zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Huchi in, haltum thillatte a tam a, haltum thillat chih ading a lemna thillat thaute, dawn ding thillat a dingte leng a tam mahmah hi. Huchi in Toupa inn nasep dan hoihtak in a hih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mipite adia Pathian inn a kintak a bawl ziak in Hezekiah leh mi tengteng a kipak mahmah ua; up louhpi a thil om guih a hih behlap hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Hezekiah in Israel gam leh Judah gam teng ah mi a sawl a, Ephraim leh Manasseh gamte ah leng Toupa Israelte Pathian ading in Paikan Ankuang neiding a Jerusalem a Toupa inn a hongpai ding in lai a khak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kumpipa leh a miliante leh Jerusalem a mipi teng in kha nihna ah, Paikan Ankuang neih a sawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huailai in a luithei naikei ua, siampu kihihsiangthoute a tam naikei ua, Jerusalem a mipi a ki kaihkhop nailouh ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A thil sawm uh kumpipa leh mipite ngaih in a dik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in Israel gam teng, Beer–sheba a kipan Dan pha in Toupa Israelte Pathian adin Paikan Ankuang neiding a Jerusalem a hongpai ding a phuang ding in thu a hihkipta hi: a dan bangtak in huchibang a tam in a hihngei naikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in lai taipihmite kumpipa leh a miliante uh laitawi in, Israel leh Judah gam tengteng a pai ding in kumpipa thupiak bang in a pawt ua, “Nou Israel suante aw, Suria kumpipate khut a kipan pawt a a damsunte Toupa , Abraham, Isak leh Israel Pathian lam hong nga nawn un, huchi a nou lam a hong ngat nawn theihna ding in .
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nou zaw na pi leh pute uh leh na unaute uh, Toupa a pi leh pute uh Pathian tung a thil hihkhial a om, segawp ding a donsak lou a na muhte uh bang in omkei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na pi leh pute uh bang in genhak nawn kei unla, Toupa kiang ah kitulut zaw unla, tangtawn a dia a hih siangthou, a Mun Siangthou ah honglut unla, Toupa na Pathian uh na sem un, huchi in a hehna thupitak na lak ua kipan a kiheimang sak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa lam na hong ngat nawn uleh na unaute uh leh na tate uh sal a man mite’n a hehpih ding ua, hiai gam ah a hongpai nawn ding uhi: Toupa na Pathian uh lah chingtheitak leh zahngaithei tak ahi ngal a, amah lam na hong ngat peuhmah uleh a hon nuse kei ding hi” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in lai taipihmite khochih ah Ephraim leh Manasseh gam tengteng ah Zebulun pha in a pai ua: himahleh amau a nuihsan in a simmawh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Himahleh Asherte leh Manassehte leh Zebulunte tampi a kitulut ua, Jerusalem ah a hoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Judah gamte ngial houh Toupa thu a kumpipa leh miliante thupiak zui ding in Pathian in lungsim mun khat a pusak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in kha nihna ah tanghou silngou sohlouh Ankuangluina nei ding in mi tampi Jerusalem ah a hong kikhawm ua, a tam mahmah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan, a thou ua, Jerusalem a maitamte a la ua, gimlim halna maitamte leng a la ua, Kidron lui ah a pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in kha nihna ni sawmlehli ni’n Paikan Ankuangluina a gou ua; siampute leh Levite a zum ua, a kihihsiangthou ua, haltum thillat toh Toupa inn ah a lalut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huan, Pathian mi Mosi dan bangtak in amau munchiat ah ading ua; siampute’n Levite a kipan a a tan uh sisan a theh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mipi lak ah lah kihihsiangthou lou a tam ua; huaiziak in Toupa ading a hih siangthou ding in a siangthouloute tuam ding in Levite’n Paikan Ankuangluina a gou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ephraim, Manasseh, Issakar, Zebulun mite tampi a ki hihsiangthou kei na ua, danlou bang in Paikan Ankuangluina a ne uhi. Himahleh Hezekiah amau ading in a thum a, “Chingthei Toupa’n :
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Michih a lungtang a Toupa , a pipute Pathian, Pathian zongte, Mun Siangthou siansakna Dan dungzui in kisiangsak kei mahleh, ngaidam hen” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in, Toupa’n Hezekiah thumna a ngaikhia a, mipite a hihdamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel mi Jerusalem a omte’n tanghou silngou sohlouh Ankuangluina nuamsatak in ni sagih a zang ua; Levite leh siampute’n kaihging ngaihtak toh Toupa pahtawi a lasa in ni teng in Toupa a phat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huan, Hezekiah in siamtak in Toupa kilawm tak a phat Levite a lungmuan hi. Huchi in Toupa a pi le pute uh Pathian kiang a thupha tawi in lemna thillatte lan in ni sagih Ankuangluina a ne tawn tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huan, mipi in ni sagih dang Ankuanglui nawn a sawm ua; huchi in ni sagih dang nuamsatak in Ankuang a lui nawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huan, Judah kumpipa Hezekiah in mipite bawngtal sang khat leh belam sang sagih goh ding in a pia a; miliante’n mipite bawngtal sang khat leh belam sing khat a pia uhi; siampu tampite a kihihsiangthou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huchi in Judah mipi tengteng siampute toh Levite toh, Israel gam a kipan a mipi hongpai tengteng leh namdang Israel gam a kipan a hongpai Judah gam a omte’n nuam a sa mahmah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huchi in nuamsakna thupitak Jerusalem ah a om a: Israel kumpipa David tapa Solomon chiang ah huchibang himhim Jerusalem ah a om ngei naikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huchi in siampu ;eh Levite a thou ua, mipite a vualzawl uhi: a aw uh ngaihkhiak in a om a, a thumna un a omna siangthou van a pha hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in, huai tengteng a hihkhit un huai a Israel mi om tengteng in Judah gam tengteng leh Benjamin gam leh Ephraim leh Manasseh gam suangphuhte a hihzan ua, Aserte a phuk ua, munsangte leh maitamte a chipsak vek masiah uh Judah gam khuate ah a pai zel uhi. Huchi in, Israel suante tengteng a gam uah amau khua chiat ah a pai nawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huan, Hezekiah in siampute leh Levite a pawl dan bangzel un michih siampute leh Levite’n a tuahchiat ding un, haltum thillat leh lemna thillat lan mi dingte, nasemmi dingte, kipahthu genmi ding leh Toupa omna kongpi a ngakmi dingte pawl a bawlsak chiat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa dan a tuang bangbang in zingsang lam leh nitaklam haltum thillat dingte, khawlni leh kha thak leh hunbi nei Ankuang a dingte kumpipa tantuan ading gan a sep hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jerusalem a mipite Toupa dan a a kihihhatna ding un siampute leh Levite tantuan pe ding in thu a pelai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huai thupiak a dalhzaktakin Israel suante’n a buhte, uainte, thaute, khuaizute, a lou ua thilsuak masapente a hongpia ua; a bangkim uh sawm a khat leng a hongpia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel suante leh Judah suante, Judah khuate a omte’n a bawng uleh belam uh sawm a khatte, Toupa a Pathian uh tantuam dia a piaksawn uh sawm a khatte a honpia ua, a koih khawm ekok phet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kha thumna ah a koihkhawm pan ua, kha sagihna ah a koihkhawm khin uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in, Hezekiah leh a miliante un koihkhawm a muh un Toupa leh a mi Israelte a phat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hezekiah in a thil koihkhawm tungtang thu uh huai siampute leh Levite a dong a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zadok mi siampu heutu Azariah in a dawng a, mite’n Toupa inn a thilpiak a hontawi tung ua kipan in i ne zel ua, i deihkhop ua, a om ekok lai hi; Toupa’n mite a vualzawl zel a, hiai a om ekok laiteng i khamval uh eive, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in Hezekiah in Toupa inn ah dantante bawl ding in thu a pia a; a bawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan, thilpiakte sawm a khatte, Pathian a tuamte muanhuaitak in a nawn lut uhi: a heutu uh Levi mi Konaniah ahi a, a unau Shimei bel a zom ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Konaniah leh a unau Shimei nuai ah kumpipa Hezekiah leh Pathian inn a heutu Azariah seh in endikmi Jehiel, Azajiah, Nahath, Asahel, Jerimoth, Jozabad, Eliel, Ismakiah, Mahath leh Benaiahte a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Levi mi Imna tapa Kore, suahlam kongkhak ngakmi Pathian kiang a lungsim ut thu a thilpiak kempa leh Toupa adia thilpiak leh thil siangthou hawmpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A nuai ah Eden, Miniamin, Jeshua, Semaiah, Amariah, Sekaniah, siampu khua ah nasep hunbi chiat ah a unaute uh a pawlpawl a lian a neute kiang a semmi a om uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khangthu a sut pasal kum thum chiang tunglam, ni teng a Toupa inn a nasep kul nei a pawl dandan bang ua hohsekte simlouh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A inkuan uh pipute gelhna a siampu a sehte leh Levi mi kum sawmnih chiang tunglam a pawl dan bangzel ua nasemmi dia sehte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pipute gelhna a tuang a ta neute tengteng uh, a zite uh, a tapate uh, a inkuan tengteng uh; a sepna bik ua siangthoutak a a ki hih siangthoute ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aron suan, khochih khaw pua a om siampute leh Levite suante gelhna a tuang peuhmahte tantuan pe ding mi sehtuam a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchibang in Judah gam tengteng ah Hezekiah in a hih a. Toupa a Pathian mitmuh in hoih leh dik leh muanhuai thil a hihsek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathian nasep lam thu ah, dan lam thu ah, thupiak lam thu ah, a Pathian zon thu ah a hih peuhmah ah a lungsim tengteng in a hih a, a lamzang zel hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchibang a muanhuaitak a thil a hihnung un Assuria kumpipa Sennakerib a hong kuan a, Judah gam ah a honglut a, kulh nei khuate a hong um a, lak a hong tum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sennakerib a hong kuan a, Jerusalem hongsual a tum chih Hezekiah in a theih in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khaw pawlam a tuite hihtat ding in a miliante leh a mi hatte a thuhilh a; huchi in a panpih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in mi tampi a kikaikhawm ua, tui tengteng leh gamsung a luangsuak luite a ching tan ua, Assuria kumpipate a honglut ua, “Tui tampi bang ding in a hongnei mahmah ding ua” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in a kihangsak ua, kulh chipna tata a bawl a, insungte leh pawlam kulhte leng a bawlhoih hi. David khua ah Millo a hihkip a, galvante leh lumte tampi a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kidouna a mipi heutute a bawl a, khopi kongkhak mun za lai ah a samkhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Hattak in, hangsantak in om unla, Assuria kumpipa leh a heute mipi lau kei unla, lunglel sam kei un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amah lam a pang sa sepaih ahi ua, ei hon panpih ding leh hon dousak ding a ei lam a pang bel Toupa i Pathian uh ahi ngal a” chi in lungmuanna thu a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huai nung in Assuria kumpipa Sennakerib in; amah leh a sepaihte Lakish ah a om ua, Judah kumpipa Hezekiah leh Jerusalem a Judah mi tengteng kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Assuria kumpipa Sennakerib in hichi in a chi, Jerusalem lak bang ahia na uplouhna uh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hezekiah in, Toupa i Pathian in Assuria kumpipa khut a kipan hon hunkhe ding, chi in gilkial leh dangtak a na sihna ding un a honkhem ahi kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hezekiah mah ahi kei maw, a munsangte leh a maitamte chimsak a Judah mi leh Jerusalem a mite kiang a, Maitam khat ah Pathian na be ding ua, gimlim na hal ding uh, chi a thu pepa?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kei leh ka pute’n gamchih namchih tung a ka thilhih uh na theikei ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kua nam pathian ahia ka pute’n a hihman uh ka khut a kipan a a mite uh hunkhe thei om a, nou Pathian in leng ka khut a kipan a a hon hutkhiak theih tuamna ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huaiziak in Hezekiah in honkhem kei henla, huchibang in honkhem kei henla, amah um kei un; bang nam pathian leh bang gam pathian himhim a mite uh ka khut a kipan leh ka pute khut a kipan hunkhe thei a omkei ua; bangchi’n na Pathian un ka khut a kipan a hon hunkhe thei tuam mahmah dia?” chi in Jerusalem ah a mite a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huan, a mite’n huai sang a thupi in Toupa Pathian leh a sikha Hezekiah tungtang thu a hoihlou lam in a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israelte Toupa Pathian suheh ding leh a gense ding in lai a gelh lai hi. “Gamchih, namchih pathiante’n ka khut a kipan a mite uh a hunkhe theilou bangmah in Hezekiah Pathian in leng ka khut a kipan a mite a hunkhe kei hial ding” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khua a lak theihna ding un a mulkimsakna ding leh lungzin sakna ding in Jerusalem a kulh a omte Judah pau in ngaihtak in a kikou khum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jerusalem Pathian mihing khut a bawl khovel pathian banglel phet in a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa Hezekiah leh Amoz tapa zawlnei Isai huaiziak in a thum ua, van a om a sam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Toupa’n angel a sawl a, huai in Assuria kumpipa giahmun a mihat hangsan tengteng leh makai heutute a that hi. Huchi in zum mahmah melpu in a gam lam ah a pai nawnta hi. Huan, a pathian inn a hohlai amah tapate mahmah in namsau in a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huchibang in Toupa’n Hezekiah leh Jerusalem a mite Assuria kumpipa Sennakerib khut a kipan leh midang tengteng khut a kipan a humbit a, a kim ua mite lak ah a veng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huan, mi tampi in Jerusalem ah Toupa adin thilpiak a hontawi ua, thil manpha pipite Judah kumpipa Hezekiah a hongpia ua; huai a kipan in namchih mitmuh in pahtawi in a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huailai in Hezekiah bel sizou ding in a china a, Toupa kiang ah a thum a; huan, a dawng a, chiamtehna a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Himahleh Hezekiah in amah ading a hoih kihih dungzui in ahihkei a, a lungtang a hong kisaktheih ziak in: huaiziak in a tung ah leh Judahte leh Jerusalem tung ah hehna a hongtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Himahleh Hezekiah in a lungtang kisaktheihna kisik in a kiniamkhiak nawn a, amah leh Jerusalem a mite toh; huchi in Hezekiah damsung in Toupa hehna a tung uah a hongtung kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huan, Hezekiah in sum leh pai a hau a, a thupita mahmah a; dangkasik, dangkaeng, suangmantam, gimlim, lum leh tuium-belsuan hoih pipi koihkhawmna in a lam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Buh, uain, leh thau koihkhawmna in leng a lamlai a; gan chiteng koihna leh belam huang leng a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huchi in, khuate leng a bawllai a, belamhon leh bawnghon a hau mahmah hi. Pathian in neizou tak in a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hezekiah mah in Gihon lui tui saknung zaw pen a hubing a, David khua tumlam pang ah a luang khesak hi. Huchi in Hezekiah a thilhih tengteng ah a lamzang zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Babulon miliante’n palai a sawl ua a gam a thillamdang a dot thu uah a lungtang om tengteng a theihtheihna ding in Pathian in a nusia in a ze-et hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hezekiah thilhih dang tengteng, a thilhih hoihte ngai dih, Amoz tapa zawlnei Isai kilakna bu, Judah kumpipa leh Israel kumpipate tanchin bu ah a tuang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hezekiah a pi leh pute kiang ah a ihmu a, David tapate han mun paitouhna ah a vui ua; Judah tengteng leh Jerusalem a mite’n a sih ni’n thupitak in a gal uhi. A tapa Manasseh in a sik in vai a hawmta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Manasseh bel a vaihawm pattung in kum sawmlehnih ahi a; Jerusalem ah kum sawmnga leh nga vai a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa mitmuh a thil hoihlou, Israel suante ma a Toupa’n a delhkhiak Pathian theilou namte’n thil kihhuaitak a hih bang uh aman leng a hihzel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A pa Hezekiah in a hihchip nung munsangte a bawlpha a, Baalte ading in maitam a bawl a, Aserah limte a bawl a, van a om tengteng a bia a, a na uh a sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Jerusalem ah tangtawn in ka min a om ding” Toupa’n a chihna Toupa inn ah maitamte a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa inn huangsung intual nih ah van a om tengteng ading in maitamte a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinnom tapa guam ah mei ah a tate a lutsak a; aisante a ching a, bumte a ching a, dawi aisan siam zawlte leh bumsiamte a guaisek a; Toupa thangpaisak ding in a mitmuh ah thil hoihlou a hih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian in David leh a tapa Solomon kiang a, “Hiai inn leh Jerusalem khua a Israel chi tengteng lak a ka tel ah ka min tangtawn in ka omsak ding, a chih khitsa Pathian inn ah amah bawl, milim bawl tawm a koih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thu ka piak tengteng leh dan tengteng, thuseh, thilhih ding Mosi zang a ka piakte a zuih peuhmah uleh a pi leh pute uh ka piaksa gam a kipan Israelte khe ka kalsuan khesak nawn kei ding” a chihna ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Manasseh in Judahte leh Jerusalem a mite thil a hihkhial sak a; Toupa’n Israelte ma a a hihman khitsa namte sang in a hihkhial zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan, Toupa’n Manasseh leh a mite kiang ah thu a gen zel a; himahleh a limsak kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa’n Assuria sepaih heutute a sawl a, Manasseh khainiang in a khih ua, Kol a bunsak ua, Babulon ah a paipihta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in, mangbang tak a a omlai in Toupa a Pathian a zong a, a pi leh pute Pathian ma ah nakpitak in a kiniamkhiak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A kiang ah a thum a, hehpih a ngen a, a ngetna a ngaihkhiak sak a, Jerusalem ah a gam ah a pai nawnta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huai nung in David khaw pawlam ah Gihon tumlam pang guam ah ngasa kongkhak lutna pha in kulh a bawl a, Ophel umsuak in sangpi in a dingsak a: Judah khua kulhnei tengteng ah heutu hangsantak tak a koih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Gamdang pathiante leh milimte, Toupa inn a kipan a paimang a, Toupa inn mual leh Jerusalem a maitam a bawl tengteng khua a kipan a paikhe vek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa maitam a bawl a, lemna thillat kithoihnate, kipahthu gennate a lan a, Judahte bel Toupa Israelte Pathian nasem ding in thu a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mipite munsang ah a kithoih lailai ua; himahleh Toupa a Pathian uh kiang ah kithoih ahi zawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Manasseh tanchin dang tengteng, a Pathian kiang a a thum thute, Toupa Israelte Pathian min a zawlnei in a kiang a thu a gente uh ngai dih, Israel kumpipate tanchin lak ah a tuang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A thumnate, Pathian in a hehpihna leh a kiniamkhiak ma in a gitlouhna tengteng, munsang a bawl a, Asher leh milim bawltawma bawlkhiakna mun tengteng leng ngai dih, Hozai tanchin gelhna bu ah a tuang vek ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in Manasseh bel a pi leh pute kiang ah a ihmu a, amah inn ah a vui ua; a tapa Ammon in a sik in vai a hawmta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ammon bel a vaihawm pattung in kum sawmnih leh nih ahi a; Jerusalem ah kum nih vai a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A pa Manasseh hihmah bang in Toupa mitmuh in thil hoihlou a hih a; a pa Manasseh in a bawl milim bawltawm tengteng kiang ah Ammon a kithoih a, a na a sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A pa Manasseh kiniamkhiak bang in Toupa ma ah a kiniamkhiak kei a. Ammon a gilou semsem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huchi in, a sikhate’n a sawm ua, amah inn ah a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Himahleh Ammon sawmmi tengteng mipi’n a thatvek nawn ua; mipite’n a tapa Josiah a sik in kumpipa ding in a bawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josiah in a vaihawm pattung in kum giat a upa ahi; Jerusalem ah kum sawmthum leh khat vai a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa mitmuh in thil hoih a hihzel a, a pu David lampite a zui a, taklam ah hiam, veilam ah hiam a pialsan kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kum giat a vaihawm kum, naupang tak a hihlai a kipan him in a pu David Pathian a zong pan a; kum sawmlehnih a vaihawm kum in Judah gam leh Jerusalem a munsangte, Asherte, milim bawltawmte, milim suntawmte a hihbei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Baal maitamte a mitmuh in a chimsak ua; huaite sang a sangzaw ni limte a phuk a; Asherte, milim bawltawmte, milim suntawmte a hihkham vek a, a kiang ua kithoihmite han tung ah a thehzak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Siampu guhte a maitamte uah a hal a, Judah gam leh Jerusalem a hihsiang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi mah bang in Manasseh, Ephraim, Simeon leh Naphtali khuate tan in ahihvek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Maitamte a chimsak a, Asherte, milim bawltawmte a hihkham a, Israel gam tengteng a milimte a phukvek a, Jerusalem ah a pai nawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huan, a vaihawm kum sawmlehgiat kum, a gam leh innte a hihsiang kum in Azaliah tapa Saphan, khaw ukpa Maaseiah, Joahaz tapa Laigelhmi Joah Toupa a Pathian inn bawlhoih ding in a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Siampu Hilkiah kiang ah a hoh ua, kongkhak ngak Levite’n Manasseh mite, Israel omlaite, Judah mi leh Benjamin mite, Jerusalem a mite kiang a kipan a na lakkhawm uh, Pathian inn a hong koih uh dangka a pia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in, Toupa inn lammi nasemmite a pia ua; Toupa inn nasem mite’n inn bawlmite leh zemmite a pia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Judah Kumpipate’n a hihsiat uh bawlhoihna ding in suangsekte, a pehnate leh a inkamte ding singleina ding in khutsiamte leh inn lammite a pia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in, mite’n muanhuaitak in nna a sem ua; a heutu uh, nasep ngaihtuahmite, Merari tapate lak a Levi mi Jahath leh Obadiah, Kohath mi tapate lak a mi Zekariah leh Mesullamte ahi ua; Levi mi, midang, thil tum siam tengteng toh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A puak a puakthoh mite heutu leh na chiteng semmite sep ding ngaihtuahmi ahi uhi: laigelhmite, heutute, kongkhak ngakmite Levi mite lak a mi ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan, Toupa inn a hong koih uh sumte a suah ua leh, siampu Hilkiah in Mosi zang a a piak Toupa dan bu a mukhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in, Hilkiah in Laigelhmi Saphan kiang ah, “ Toupa inn ah danbu i mu kheta uh” a chi a. Huan Hilkiah in laibu Saphan a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huan, Saphan in laibu kumpipa kiang ah a paipih a, “Na sikhate’n hih ding a seh tengteng a hih uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Toupa inn a dangka om a bungkhia ua, heutute leh nasemmite a pia uh” chi in thu a tun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Laigelhmi Saphan in, “siampu Hilkiah in laibu a honpia” chi in kumpipa a hilh a, kumpipa ma ah a sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, kumpipa’n Danthute a zak in, a puan a botkek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kumpipa’n Hilkiah, Saphan tapa Ahikam, Mikah tapa Abdon, Laigelhmi Saphan leh kumpipa sikha Asaiah thu a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Kuan unla, danthu na muhkhiak tungtang thu uah kei leh Israel leh Judah gam a mite ading in Toupa hon dotsak dih ua; I pi leh pute’n hiai danbu a tuang bang a Toupa thu a zuihlouh ziak un i tung uah Toupa thangpaihna a hongom mahmah ngal a” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa’n thu a piakmite leh Hilkiah puansilh kempa Hasrah tapa Tokhat tapa Shallum zi zawlnei Huldah kiang ah a vahoh ua, huai thu ah a va houpih uhi. Amah bel Jerusalem Misneh a om ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huan, aman a kiang uah, Toupa , Israelte Pathian in hichi in a chi; “Ka kiang a nou hon sawlpa hilh unla, Toupa’n hichi in a chi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />‘Ngai dih ua, hiai mun leh asung a omte tung ah thil hoihlou ka tungsak ding a, Judah kumpipa ma a ki simkhia, laibu a tuang hamsia tengteng leng;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A khut thilhih ua hon hehsakna ding ua hon lehngatsan a milim dangte ding a gimlim a hal ziak un hiai mun tung ah ka hehna sun ahi a, daihsak ahi kei ding,’ chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Himahleh Toupa thu dong ding a nou hon sawlpa Judah kumpipa kiang ah, hichibang in chi un, ’ Toupa , Israelte Pathian in hichi in a chi: Na thuzakte tungtang thu ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na lungtang hihnem a a om ziak a Pathian ma a na kiniamkhiak a, hiai mun tungtang thu leh asung a omte tungtang thu na zak a, ka ma a na kiniamkhiak a, na puan na bohkek a, ka ma a na kah ziak in ken leng na thu ka na ngaikhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ngai dih, na pi leh na pute kiang ah k’on hohsak ding a, na han ah lungmuangtakin na pai ding a, hiai mun leh asung a omte tung a k’on tunsak ding thil hoihlou tengteng na mit in a mu kei ding, chi in, gen in’ ” a chi hi. Huchi in, kumpipa kiang ah thu a tunta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa’n mi a sawl a, Judah gam leh Jerusalem a Upa tengteng a samkhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huchi in, kumpipa leh Judah mi tengteng leh Jerusalem a mi tengteng, siampu leh Levite, mipi tengteng a lian a neu in Toupa inn ah a hohtou ua; Toupa inn a muhkhiak thukhun bu a thu tengteng a bil ua zak in a sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Kumpipa bel a mun ah ading a, huai laibu a tuang thukunte hihkip ding in a lungtang tengteng, a kha tengteng a Toupa zuiding leh a thupiakte, a thu theihsakte, a thusehte pom ding in Toupa ma ah thu a khung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jerusalem leh Benjamin mi tengteng huchibang a om ding in a chi ua. Huan, Jerusalem a mite’n Pathian, a pi leh pute uh Pathian thukhun bang in a hih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Huchi in, Josiah hi in Israel gam in a huap tengteng a kipan thilkihhuai tengteng a paimang a, Israel gam a om tengteng Toupa a Pathian uh na a semsak hi. A damsung in Toupa a pi leh pute uh Pathian a zuih uh a pialsan kei uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Josiah in Jerusalem ah Toupa din Paikan Ankuang a bawl a; a kha khatna, ni sawm leh ni li ni’n Paikan Ankuangluina ding a gou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in, siampute a nasep uh a sehsak a, Toupa inn a nasepna sem ding in a hanthawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel mite sinsakmi, Pathian ading a hihtuam Levite kiang ah, “Israel kumpipa David tapa Solomon inn lam ah bawm siangthou koih un; na liangzang ua zawn a kiphamohta kei ding; Toupa na Pathian uh leh a mi Israelte na semta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel kumpipa David gelh bang leh a tapa Solomon gelh bang in na inkuan intekpen dungzui zel in a pawlpawl in kisa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na unaute uh inkuan intekpen dungzui zel in Levite tuam a tantuan nei in Mun Siangthou ah om un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Paikan Ankuangluina ding gou unla, kihihsiangthou unla, Mosi zang a Toupa gen bang hih ding in na unaute uh ding in bawl un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in, Josiah in huai a mi om tengteng Paikan Ankuang adia lan ding in ganhon lak a belamnou leh kel nou sing thum leh bawngtal sang thum a pia a: huaite kumpipa sum lak a ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A miliante’n mipite, siampute, Levite amau ut thu a lan ding in a pia uhi. Pathian inn heutu, Hilkiah, Zekariah leh Jehielte’n Paikan Ankuang dia lan ding in gan nou sang nih leh za guk leh bawngtal za thum siampute a pia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Konaniah, a unau Semaiah leh Nethaneel, Levite heutu Hasabiah, Zeiel leh Jozabadte’n leng Paikan Ankuang dia lat ding in Levite gan nou sang nga leh bawngtal za nga a pia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in nasepna a bawl ua, kumpipa thupiak bang in siampute a mun uah ading ua, Levite a pawl dan bangzel un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Paikan Ankuangluina ding a gou ua, siampute’n sisan a theh ua, Levite’n a vun a hawk uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan, Mosi laibu a tuang bang a inkuan khen dan dungzui zel a Toupa kiang a lat ding a piak ding in haltum thillatte a lasawn ua. Bawngtalte leng huchi mah bang in a hih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in, Paikan Ankuangluina ding a dan bang in a em min ua; thillat siangthou sa bel, bel, bel khainanei, bel gongza in a ui ua, mi tengteng kiang ah a paipih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huaikhit in amau leh siampute ading a bawl ua; Aron ta siampute haltum thillat leh sathau lan in zan tanpha in a buai ngal ua; huaiziak in Levite’n amau leh Aron ta siampute ading a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />David, Asaph, Heman leh kumpipa zawlnei Jeduthunte thupiak bang in lasami Ashaph tapate a mun uah ading ua, kongkhak ngakmite bel kongkhak chih ah a om ua; a unau Levite’n a bawlsak ziak un a na uh paisan a kiphamoh kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa Josiah thupiak bang a Paikan Ankuang nei ding leh Toupa maitam a haltum thillat lan ding in huai ni mah in Toupa nasepna thil tengteng a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in, Israel suan huailai a omte’n huai ni’n Paikan Ankuang a bawl ua, tanghou silngou sohlouh Ankuang leng ni sagih a bawl lai uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zawlnei Samuel damlai a kipan Israel gam ah Paikan Ankuang huchibang himhim a bawl ngeikei ua; Israel kumpipa kuamah in Josiah leh siampute leh Levite leh Judah tengteng leh Israelte’n a neih bang uh nei a omsam kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kum sawmlehgiat Josiah vaihawm kum in huai Paikan Ankuang a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huai tengteng khit a Josiah in biakin a bawlkhit in, Aigupta kumpipa Neko Karkhemish sual ding in Euphrates lui ah a paitou a; Josiah in a vasual hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Himahleh, aman, “Nang Judah kumpipa, kei leh nang bang ahia i kihihna ding om? Nang sual ding in ka hongpai kei a, ka dousa dou ding in ahizaw ka hong, Pathian in kin ding in thu honpia a, ka lam a pang Pathian doudal kei dih, a hon hihmang kha ding hi” chi in palai a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Himahleh Josiah in a kiksan nuam kei a, a dou theihna ding in a kibawl lamdang a, Pathian kam a kipan a Neko thugen a pom kei a, Meggiddo guam ah na sual ding in a kuan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huchi in, thalkap mite’n Josiah a kapkha ua; kumpipa’n a sikhate kiang ah, “Hon paimangpih un, liamna thupi mahmah ka tuakta” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huchi in a sikhate’n kangtalai a kipan a lakhia ua, a kangtalai dang ah a koih ua, Jerusalem ah a paipih ua, a si a, a pi leh pute han ah a vui uhi. Judah mi tengteng leh Jerusalem a mite’n Josiah a sun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huan, Jeremiah in Josiah a kah a; lasami numei leh pasalte’n tutan in Josiah a kahna la uh a gen lailai uhi. Israel gam ah dan in a nei ua, ngai dih, kahna la ah a tuangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Josiah thilhih dang tengteng, a thilhih hoihte, Toupa dan bu a gelh bangzel in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A masapen a nanungpente leng, ngai dih, Israel kumpipa leh Judah kumpipate tanchinbu ah a tuang hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huai gam a mite’n Josiah tapa Jehoahaz a pi ua, Jerusalem ah a pa sik in kumpipa in a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jehoahaz bel a vaihawmpat tung in kum sawmnih leh thum ahi a, Jerusalem ah kha thum vai a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aigupta kumpipa’n Jerusalem a a vaihawmna a tawpsak a, a gam uh dangkasik talent za leh dangkaeng talent khat a liausak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aigupta kumpipa’n a unaupa Eliakim Judah leh Jerusalem a kumpipa ding in a bawl a, a min Jehoiakim chi’n a khensak hi. Huchi in, Neko in a unaupa Jehoahaz Aigupta gam ah a pi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jehoiakim bel a vaihawmpat tung in kum sawmnih leh nga ahi a, Jerusalem ah kum sawmlehkhat a vai a hawm hi: Toupa a Pathian mitmuh in thil hoihlou a hih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar amah sual ding in a hong kuan a, Babulon a pi ding in kol a bunsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nebukadnezzar in Toupa inn a tuium-belsuan leng Babulon ah a pua a, Babulon a pathian biakin ah a koih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jehoiakim tanchin dangte, a thil kihhuai hihte leh a omdante ngai dih, Israel kumpipa leh Judah kumpipate tanchin bu ah a tuang hi; huan, a tapa Jehoiakin in a sik in vai a hawmta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jehoiakin a vaihawm pattung in kum giat ahi a, Jerusalem ah kha thum leh ni sawm vai a hawm a, Toupa mitmuh in thil hoihlou a hih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kum a bei in kumpipa Nebukadnezzar in mi a sawl a, Toupa in a tuium-belsuan hoih pipite toh Babulon ah a pisak a, a unaupa Zedekiah Judah gam leh Jerusalem a kumpipa ding in a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zedekiah a vaihawmpat tung in kum sawmnih leh khat ahi a, Jerusalem ah kum sawmlehkhat vai a hawm hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa a Pathian mitmuh in thil hoihlou a hih a; Toupa kam a kipan a thugenpa zawlnei Jeremiah lak ah a kiniamkhiak nuam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian min a kichiamsakpa kumpipa Nebukadnezzar tung ah a hellai a, paupeng in a om a, Toupa Israel Pathian lam ngalou ding in a lungsim a khauhsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Siampu heutu tengteng leh mipite’n leng Pathian theilou mite mah bang in thilkihhuai pipite a hih ua; Jerusalem a hih siangthou Toupa innte leng a hihbuah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in, Toupa’n a mite leh a omna mun a lainat ziak in a pi leh pute uh Pathian in a kiang uah theihtawp a phatuamngai in mi a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Himahleh Pathian misawlte a musit ua, a thute a ngaineu ua, a mite tung ah Toupa hehna a hong thou a, hih lungdam nawnna mahmah omlou khop in a zawlnei a hihgim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huaiziak in Kaldai kumpipa a tung uah a gamtang sak a, aman a tangvalte uh a Mun Siangthou uah namsau in a that a, nungak leh tangval leng, tek leng, teksia leng lainatna a neikei a; a khut ah a pevek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathian inn a tuium-belsuan tengteng, a lian leh a neu leng, Toupa inn a sum koihkhawm tengteng, kumpipa sum koihkhawm leh a miliante sum koihkhawmte nangawn in Babulon ah a pawvek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian innte a hal a, Jerusalem kulhte a chimsak a, huailai a inn thupi tengteng a hal a, huailai a tuium-belsuan hoih tengteng a hihse vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Namsau thah bang teng Babulon ah a pi a, Persiate a honglal tak un amah leh a tapate sikha in a om uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A khawlnite gam in nuamtak a a zattan a Jeremiah kam a gen Toupa thu a tangtunna ding in: segawp a a omsung teng, kum sawmsagih tangtunna ding in, a khawlnite a tang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huchi in Persia kumpipa Kura vaihawm tung kum in Jeremiah kam a Toupa thu a tun kim theihna ding in a gam tengteng a thankhiak vek ding leh a gelh a gelh ding in leng Toupa’n Persia kumpipa Kura lungtang a tokthou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Persia kumpipa Kura in hichi in a chi, “Khovel gam tengteng Toupa van Pathian in a honpia a; Judah gam a Jerusalem ah a inn lamsak ding in thu a honpia ahi. Na lak ua amah mite photphot kiang ah Toupa a Pathian om henla, va hohtou uhen” chi in.
  </para>
</usx>
